ble 2/1190). Qwen VOTA: seed42=99.41%, seed456=99.08% (Δ<0.4pp). DeepSeek\n    exception_only: seed42/456=99.33%, seed123=91.09% (LoRA outlier). Registry IDs:\n    exception_only_seed123, exception_only_seed456, vota_seed456_v2, deepseek_exception_only_seed42/123/456.'\n- id: plan_mvp_vota\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'MVP: VOTA trace SFT for test verdict prediction'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps: []\n  registry_id: vota_seed42_v4\n  notes: 完成。95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp over baseline.\n- id: plan_mvp_notrace\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'MVP: No-trace baseline for test verdict prediction'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n  deps: []\n  registry_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\n  notes: 完成。75.13% accuracy (majority baseline 71.51%).\n- id: plan_mvp_fulltrace\n  claim: 2\n  description: 'MVP: Full execution trace SFT for test verdict prediction'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n  deps: []\n  registry_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\n  notes: 完成。28.49% accuracy, model collapse (100% predict fail).\n- id: plan_012\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Cross-scale validation: Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B 上复现 4 条件 (exception_only/vota/no_trace/full_trace)。\n    验证 exception signal 的 scale invariance 假说。'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 8\n  deps:\n  - plan_003\n  registry_id: qwen15b_exception_only_seed42\n  notes: '4 条件: exception_only=99.83% (=7B, DONE), vota=99.58% (DONE), no_trace=67.31%\n    (DONE), full_trace=RUNNING。关键发现: 1.5B=7B on exception → signal-limited not capacity-limited。\n    Registry IDs: qwen15b_exception_only_seed42, qwen15b_vota_seed42, qwen15b_no_trace_seed42,\n    qwen15b_full_trace_seed42。'\n- id: plan_013\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Cross-family validation: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct 上测试 3 条件 (exception_only/no_trace/vota)。\n    验证 exception dominance 跨 LLaMA 家族 + 更大 scale 的泛化性。'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 12\n  deps: []\n  registry_id: codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\n  notes: 'Model downloaded. 0/3 done, queued. Registry IDs: codellama13b_exception_only_seed42,\n    codellama13b_no_trace_seed42, codellama13b_vota_seed42。回应 R2-N2 scope concern:\n    4 models × 3 families × 2 scales。'\n- id: plan_014\n  claim: 3\n  description: 'Multi-seed expansion: loop_only + ae_only + label_only 各 3 seeds。\n    回应 R2-N3 single-seed concern，验证 Tier 层级划分稳定性。'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 12\n  deps:\n  - plan_003\n  registry_id: ae_only_seed123\n  notes: 'ae_only 3-seed done (mean 99.64%). label_only 3-seed done (mean 86.39%).\n    loop_only: seed42 done, seed123 RUNNING, seed456 queued。Registry IDs: ae_only_seed123/456,\n    label_only_seed123/456, loop_only_seed123/456。'\n- id: plan_015\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Format marker removal control: 移除 [No exception data in trace] 格式标记后重训\n    exception_only × 3 seeds。回应 R1-N1 format shortcut concern。'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 6\n  deps: []\n  registry_id: exception_only_nomarker_seed42\n  notes: '计划中。如果移除标记后 SFT 仍 ≥99%，证明模型学到的是异常语义而非格式 shortcut。 Registry IDs: exception_only_nomarker_seed42/123/456。'\n- id: plan_016\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Fine-grained phase transition: tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual。'\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 16\n  deps:\n  - plan_006\n  notes: '4 模型各 1 个实验。如果 tail-384 仍在 ~77% (≈tail-256)，证明 transition 是 sharp；如果 ~85%，证明是 gradual。对 phase transition claim 的强度有决定性影响。'\n- id: plan_017\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Cross-seed budget curve: tail-512 × 4 模型 × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band 的 robustness。'\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 24\n  deps:\n  - plan_016\n  notes: 'tail-512 是 phase transition 后第一个点，验证 93-97% convergence 是否 seed-robust。审稿人必问 single-seed robustness。'\n- id: plan_018\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Error analysis: 用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析 failure modes（哪类程序/错误容易被误判）。不需 GPU。'\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps: []\n  notes: '分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的错误模式差异。重点关注 Tier 1 vs Tier 2 的 failure mode 是否不同。'\n- id: plan_019\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'Cross-model calibration: 4 模型 × exception_only 的 ECE/Brier 对比。验证 calibration quality 跨模型 universal。'\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n  deps: []\n  notes: '纯 eval，用已有 checkpoint。当前只有 Qwen-7B 的 calibration 数据，需要扩展到 4 模型。'\n- id: plan_020\n  claim: 2\n  description: 'Few-shot prompting baseline: GPT-4o/Claude 直接判断 pass/fail（0-shot + 3-shot），作为 non-SFT upper bound 对比。'\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps: []\n  notes: '不需 GPU，用 API 调用。如果 few-shot < exception_only SFT，说明 SFT 在 verdict task 上超越 frontier model 的 few-shot 能力，claim 更强。'\n- id: plan_021\n  claim: 1\n  description: 'OOD generalization: 在不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性。'\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 12\n  deps: []\n  notes: '需要构建 OOD 测试集（不同语言的 trace）。如果 exception_only 在 OOD 上仍强，大幅强化 generalization claim。'\n- id: plan_022\n  claim: 2\n  description: 'Training dynamics: 记录 exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve（每 50 steps eval），分析收敛速度差异。'\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 8\n  deps: []\n  notes: '如果 exception_only 收敛更快，支持 information density 假说。需要修改训练脚本加 intermediate eval。'\n","numLines":214,"startLine":1,"totalLines":214}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018Hiyeb3mqMrBhotuB7En28","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median 档结果总结：7 个 planned 实验全部符合 ''pattern exists but model-dependent''\n3\t  预期。 plan_016 (tail-384) 确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 分化为两组——强模型 (Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B)\n4\t  gradual，弱模型 (DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B) sharp——''universal sharp phase transition'' 降级为\n5\t  ''consistent trend with model-dependent transition characteristics''。plan_017 (cross-seed)\n6\t  std 范围 0.4-3.5pp 证明 budget curve reproducible 但 variance 与模型强度相关。plan_019 确认 exception_only\n7\t  near-perfect calibration 跨 4 模型通用（非离群 ECE ≤ 0.01）。plan_020 确认 SFT 优于 frontier model\n8\t  few-shot 3-5pp，支持 SFT practical recommendation 但非压倒性优势。 plan_018 和 plan_022 提供 supporting\n9\t  evidence 但不升级任何 claim。plan_021 是最大风险——跨语言 泛化可能大幅降级。总体：Claim 1 + Claim 3 核心证据不受影响，budget\n10\t  curve 保留为 supporting evidence， EMNLP main 有竞争力 (P≈0.35-0.45) 但 scope concern + model-dependent\n11\t  phase transition 需 strong rebuttal。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n16\t  plan_id: plan_016\n17\t  description: tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.855\n20\t    qwen7b_tail384_ci:\n21\t    - 0.832\n22\t    - 0.877\n23\t    qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.6\n24\t    qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -8.1\n25\t    qwen7b_transition_type: gradual\n26\t    deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.805\n27\t    deepseek_tail384_ci:\n28\t    - 0.781\n29\t    - 0.829\n30\t    deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 4.1\n31\t    deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -13.4\n32\t    deepseek_transition_type: sharp\n33\t    qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.79\n34\t    qwen15b_tail384_ci:\n35\t    - 0.765\n36\t    - 0.815\n37\t    qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.4\n38\t    qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -16.6\n39\t    qwen15b_transition_type: sharp\n40\t    codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.875\n41\t    codellama13b_tail384_ci:\n42\t    - 0.854\n43\t    - 0.896\n44\t    codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n45\t    codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -10.0\n46\t    codellama13b_transition_type: gradual\n47\t    four_model_mean: 0.831\n48\t    sharp_models_mean: 0.798\n49\t    gradual_models_mean: 0.865\n50\t    max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n51\t  result_rationale: 'tail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384\n52\t    能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因： (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B\n53\t    CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception 信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384\n54\t    tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition； (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B\n55\t    仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512\n56\t    区间——呈 sharp transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer\n57\t    差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace reasoning\n58\t    能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小， loss landscape 更陡峭，384\n59\t    tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t  tables:\n63\t  - title: 'Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)'\n64\t    headers:\n65\t    - Model\n66\t    - tail-256 (%)\n67\t    - tail-384 (%)\n68\t    - tail-512 (%)\n69\t    - tail-1024 (%)\n70\t    - tail-2048 (%)\n71\t    - Δ(256→384)\n72\t    - Δ(384→512)\n73\t    - Transition\n74\t    rows:\n75\t    - - Qwen-7B\n76\t      - 78.9\n77\t      - 85.5\n78\t      - 93.6\n79\t      - 96.5\n80\t      - 97.3\n81\t      - +6.6pp\n82\t      - +8.1pp\n83\t      - Gradual\n84\t    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n85\t      - 76.4\n86\t      - 80.5\n87\t      - 93.9\n88\t      - 96.5\n89\t      - 95.0\n90\t      - +4.1pp\n91\t      - +13.4pp\n92\t      - Sharp\n93\t    - - Qwen-1.5B\n94\t      - 72.6\n95\t      - 79.0\n96\t      - 95.6\n97\t      - 96.6\n98\t      - 97.9\n99\t      - +6.4pp\n100\t      - +16.6pp\n101\t      - Sharp\n102\t    - - CodeLlama-13B\n103\t      - 77.9\n104\t      - 87.5\n105\t      - 97.5\n106\t      - 98.2\n107\t      - collapse\n108\t      - +9.6pp\n109\t      - +10.0pp\n110\t      - Gradual\n111\t  figures_description:\n112\t  - 'Budget curve figure (4-panel or overlay): x-axis = tail token budget [256, 384,\n113\t    512, 1024, 2048], y-axis = accuracy (%)。4 条模型曲线，384 处标注 transition type。Gradual\n114\t    模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama）曲线在 256→512 段近似线性上升；Sharp 模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）曲线在 256→384\n115\t    段平缓、384→512 段陡升，呈 S 型。水平虚线标注 exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。'\n116\t  - 'Transition sharpness scatter: x-axis = model capability proxy (CRUXEval-I 或 param\n117\t    count), y-axis = Δ(384-256)/Δ(512-256) ratio (越高越 gradual)。4 点+回归线，展示 capability→gradualness\n118\t    正相关。'\n119\t  analysis: 'tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。\n120\t    两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。 这直接影响论文\n121\t    claim：不能说 ''universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens''，需降级为 ''consistent\n122\t    accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics: stronger\n123\t    models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds''。 积极面：4-model\n124\t    mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含 有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512\n125\t    均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增\n126\t    model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness 与 model capability 的相关性分析。\n127\t\n128\t    '\n129\t- name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n130\t  plan_id: plan_017\n131\t  description: tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band\n132\t    robustness\n133\t  expected_results:\n134\t    qwen7b_seed42: 0.936\n135\t    qwen7b_seed123: 0.924\n136\t    qwen7b_seed456: 0.943\n137\t    qwen7b_mean: 0.934\n138\t    qwen7b_std_pp: 1.0\n139\t    deepseek_seed42: 0.939\n140\t    deepseek_seed123: 0.885\n141\t    deepseek_seed456: 0.942\n142\t    deepseek_mean: 0.922\n143\t    deepseek_std_pp: 3.2\n144\t    qwen15b_seed42: 0.956\n145\t    qwen15b_seed123: 0.9\n146\t    qwen15b_seed456: 0.938\n147\t    qwen15b_mean: 0.931\n148\t    qwen15b_std_pp: 2.9\n149\t    codellama13b_seed42: 0.975\n150\t    codellama13b_seed123: 0.968\n151\t    codellama13b_seed456: 0.978\n152\t    codellama13b_mean: 0.974\n153\t    codellama13b_std_pp: 0.5\n154\t    max_std_across_models_pp: 3.2\n155\t    strong_model_avg_std_pp: 0.75\n156\t    weak_model_avg_std_pp: 3.05\n157\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning\n158\t    稳定性。 逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量 赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B,\n159\t    CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到 类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek,\n160\t    Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape 更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity\n161\t    (seed123=91.09% vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的\n162\t    noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank 相对于\n163\t    total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其 exception_only seed123\n164\t    (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。 CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp)\n165\t    因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512 的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\n166\t\n167\t    '\n168\t  tables:\n169\t  - title: Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\n170\t    headers:\n171\t    - Model\n172\t    - Seed42\n173\t    - Seed123\n174\t    - Seed456\n175\t    - Mean\n176\t    - Std\n177\t    - Band Width\n178\t    rows:\n179\t    - - Qwen-7B\n180\t      - 93.6%\n181\t      - 92.4%\n182\t      - 94.3%\n183\t      - 93.4%\n184\t      - 1.0pp\n185\t      - 1.9pp\n186\t    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n187\t      - 93.9%\n188\t      - 88.5%\n189\t      - 94.2%\n190\t      - 92.2%\n191\t      - 3.2pp\n192\t      - 5.7pp\n193\t    - - Qwen-1.5B\n194\t      - 95.6%\n195\t      - 90.0%\n196\t      - 93.8%\n197\t      - 93.1%\n198\t      - 2.9pp\n199\t      - 5.6pp\n200\t    - - CodeLlama-13B\n201\t      - 97.5%\n202\t      - 96.8%\n203\t      - 97.8%\n204\t      - 97.4%\n205\t      - 0.5pp\n206\t      - 1.0pp\n207\t  - title: Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\n208\t    headers:\n209\t    - Group\n210\t    - Models\n211\t    - Avg Std\n212\t    - Avg Band Width\n213\t    - Interpretation\n214\t    rows:\n215\t    - - Strong\n216\t      - Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\n217\t      - 0.75pp\n218\t      - 1.5pp\n219\t      - 'Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth'\n220\t    - - Weak\n221\t      - DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\n222\t      - 3.05pp\n223\t      - 5.7pp\n224\t      - 'Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged'\n225\t  figures_description:\n226\t  - 'Band plot: x-axis = tail token budget, y-axis = accuracy。每个模型一条中线 (mean) + shaded\n227\t    band (min-max across 3 seeds)。强模型 band 窄，弱模型 band 宽。在 tail-512 处用 error bar 标注\n228\t    3-seed CI。'\n229\t  - 'Seed variance vs model capability scatter: x-axis = CRUXEval-I (或 param count\n230\t    log scale), y-axis = tail-512 3-seed std (pp)。4 点 + power fit，展示 capability↑ →\n231\t    variance↓ 趋势。'\n232\t  analysis: 'Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在\n233\t    92-97% 区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须 使用的\n234\t    hedged language：不能说 ''tail-512 reliably achieves >93%''，需改为 ''tail-512 mean accuracy\n235\t    ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models (std < 1pp) and\n236\t    wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)''。审稿人问 ''single-seed robustness'' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明\n237\t    budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 > tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256)\n238\t    在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust； absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA\n239\t    training 问题而非 signal 问题——与 exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t- name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n243\t  plan_id: plan_018\n244\t  description: 分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier\n245\t    1 vs Tier 2 差异\n246\t  expected_results:\n247\t    qwen_exception_only_errors: 2\n248\t    qwen_exception_only_error_ids:\n249\t    - 901\n250\t    - 905\n251\t    qwen_exception_only_root_cause: 100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\n252\t    qwen_exception_only_error_direction: 100% pass→fail false alarm\n253\t    qwen_vota_errors: 7\n254\t    qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n255\t    qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors: 3\n256\t    qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors: 2\n257\t    qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio: 0.57\n258\t    qwen_full_trace_errors: 217\n259\t    qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.35\n260\t    qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.08\n261\t    qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.65\n262\t    qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r: 0.42\n263\t    qwen_no_trace_errors: 296\n264\t    qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.63\n265\t    qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction: 0.37\n266\t    deepseek_seed123_errors: 106\n267\t    deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.72\n268\t    deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible: 2\n269\t    exception_only_cross_model_jaccard: 0.85\n270\t    full_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.15\n271\t    no_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.25\n272\t  result_rationale: 'Error analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure\n273\t    modes： (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer\n274\t    设计 缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/ representation\n275\t    property 而非 model property。 (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression\n276\t    有时产生误导性 摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接\n277\t    支持 Claim 3 的 ''combining tiers introduces noise'' 论点。 (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace\n278\t    长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35% vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload\n279\t    pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%）， 说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority\n280\t    class。 (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。 (5) DeepSeek\n281\t    seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致—— LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail\n282\t    映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t  tables:\n286\t  - title: Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\n287\t    headers:\n288\t    - Condition\n289\t    - Total Errors\n290\t    - fail→pass (%)\n291\t    - pass→fail (%)\n292\t    - Dominant Pattern\n293\t    rows:\n294\t    - - exception_only\n295\t      - 2\n296\t      - 0%\n297\t      - 100%\n298\t      - GeneratorExit irreducible\n299\t    - - VOTA\n300\t      - 7\n301\t      - 57%\n302\t      - 43%\n303\t      - Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\n304\t    - - full_trace\n305\t      - 217\n306\t      - 65%\n307\t      - 35%\n308\t      - Information overload (length-correlated)\n309\t    - - no_trace\n310\t      - 296\n311\t      - 63%\n312\t      - 37%\n313\t      - Majority class bias\n314\t  - title: Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\n315\t    headers:\n316\t    - Length Bucket\n317\t    - N Samples\n318\t    - Errors\n319\t    - Error Rate\n320\t    - Interpretation\n321\t    rows:\n322\t    - - <500 tokens\n323\t      - ~180\n324\t      - ~14\n325\t      - ~8%\n326\t      - 'Short traces: fault signal accessible'\n327\t    - - 500-1000 tokens\n328\t      - ~350\n329\t      - ~56\n330\t      - ~16%\n331\t      - 'Medium: partial signal loss'\n332\t    - - 1000-1500 tokens\n333\t      - ~380\n334\t      - ~76\n335\t      - ~20%\n336\t      - 'Long: significant overload'\n337\t    - - '>1500 tokens'\n338\t      - ~280\n339\t      - ~98\n340\t      - ~35%\n341\t      - 'Very long: severe information overload'\n342\t  - title: Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\n343\t    headers:\n344\t    - Model Pair\n345\t    - Jaccard\n346\t    - Shared Errors\n347\t    - Interpretation\n348\t    rows:\n349\t    - - Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\n350\t      - 0.9\n351\t      - 2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\n352\t      - Same representation → same irreducible errors\n353\t    - - Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\n354\t      - 0.8\n355\t      - 2/~2.5 avg\n356\t      - Different tokenizer but same root cause\n357\t    - - Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\n358\t      - 0.22\n359\t      - 2/~10\n360\t      - DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\n361\t  figures_description:\n362\t  - 'Confusion matrix grid (2×4): 4 conditions × Qwen-7B，展示 error direction 差异。exception_only\n363\t    和 VOTA 几乎完美（极少 off-diagonal），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail→pass 偏移。'\n364\t  - 'Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace only): x-axis = input token count,\n365\t    y-axis = binary correct/incorrect，加 binned error rate 趋势线。展示 information overload\n366\t    的 dose-response 关系。'\n367\t  - 'Venn diagram: exception_only vs VOTA 错误重叠（Qwen-7B），展示 VOTA 额外错误全来自 Tier 2 noise。'\n368\t  analysis: 'Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible error\n369\t    来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0）， 强化 ''99.83% =\n370\t    ceiling'' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components， 直接 quantify 了 ''combining\n371\t    tiers introduces noise'' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误 与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2\n372\t    information overload 假说的 direct evidence。 不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为\n373\t    expected follow-up）， 但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary\n374\t    或 Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t- name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n378\t  plan_id: plan_019\n379\t  description: 4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\n380\t  expected_results:\n381\t    qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n382\t    qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n383\t    qwen7b_accuracy: 0.9983\n384\t    qwen15b_ece: 0.003\n385\t    qwen15b_brier: 0.0015\n386\t    qwen15b_accuracy: 0.9983\n387\t    codellama13b_ece: 0.002\n388\t    codellama13b_brier: 0.001\n389\t    codellama13b_accuracy: 0.9983\n390\t    deepseek_seed42_ece: 0.008\n391\t    deepseek_seed42_brier: 0.005\n392\t    deepseek_seed42_accuracy: 0.9933\n393\t    deepseek_seed123_ece: 0.085\n394\t    deepseek_seed123_brier: 0.075\n395\t    deepseek_seed123_accuracy: 0.9109\n396\t    four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.008\n397\t    four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max: 0.005\n398\t    ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min: 21.0\n399\t    ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max: 85.5\n400\t  result_rationale: 'Calibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅\n401\t    2 个 相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit confidence\n402\t    接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列\n403\t    tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration 差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B\n404\t    参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。 DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors)\n405\t    的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着 更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek\n406\t    seed123 (91.09%) 是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence\n407\t    pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE 均 ≤ 0.008，与\n408\t    no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal 不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally\n409\t    improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\n410\t\n411\t    '\n412\t  tables:\n413\t  - title: 'Cross-model Calibration: exception_only'\n414\t    headers:\n415\t    - Model\n416\t    - Accuracy\n417\t    - ECE\n418\t    - Brier\n419\t    - ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\n420\t    - Notes\n421\t    rows:\n422\t    - - Qwen-7B\n423\t      - 99.83%\n424\t      - 0.0027\n425\t      - 0.0013\n426\t      - 63×\n427\t      - 3-seed confirmed; existing data\n428\t    - - Qwen-1.5B\n429\t      - 99.83%\n430\t      - 0.003\n431\t      - 0.0015\n432\t      - 57×\n433\t      - Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\n434\t    - - CodeLlama-13B\n435\t      - 99.83%\n436\t      - 0.002\n437\t      - 0.001\n438\t      - 86×\n439\t      - Largest model → sharpest calibration\n440\t    - - DeepSeek (seed42/456)\n441\t      - 99.33%\n442\t      - 0.008\n443\t      - 0.005\n444\t      - 21×\n445\t      - 8 errors; still excellent\n446\t    - - DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\n447\t      - 91.09%\n448\t      - 0.085\n449\t      - 0.075\n450\t      - 2×\n451\t      - LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\n452\t  figures_description:\n453\t  - 'Reliability diagram (4-panel): 每个模型一个 calibration curve (predicted prob vs actual\n454\t    frequency)。3 个非离群模型的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration 对角线重合；DeepSeek seed123 curve 偏离对角线（overconfident\n455\t    on pass predictions for actual-fail samples）。'\n456\t  - 'ECE bar chart: 4 models × exception_only + Qwen-7B no_trace/full_trace/VOTA 作对照。exception_only\n457\t    的 bar 在所有模型上极短（≤0.008），no_trace bar (0.171) 显著突出。'\n458\t  analysis: 'Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal\n459\t    property 而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：''exception_only achieves near-perfect\n460\t    calibration (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement\n461\t    over no-trace baselines''。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem\n462\t    而非 calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值： calibration\n463\t    是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83% 可能 saturated，ECE/Brier\n464\t    提供模型 ''knows what it knows'' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2 或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与\n465\t    accuracy table 并列。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t- name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n469\t  plan_id: plan_020\n470\t  description: GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\n471\t  expected_results:\n472\t    gpt4o_0shot_exception_only: 0.945\n473\t    gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci:\n474\t    - 0.93\n475\t    - 0.96\n476\t    gpt4o_3shot_exception_only: 0.965\n477\t    gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci:\n478\t    - 0.95\n479\t    - 0.98\n480\t    claude_0shot_exception_only: 0.935\n481\t    claude_0shot_exception_only_ci:\n482\t    - 0.92\n483\t    - 0.95\n484\t    claude_3shot_exception_only: 0.96\n485\t    claude_3shot_exception_only_ci:\n486\t    - 0.945\n487\t    - 0.975\n488\t    gpt4o_3shot_no_trace: 0.835\n489\t    claude_3shot_no_trace: 0.82\n490\t    sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n491\t    sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp: 3.3\n492\t    sft_qwen15b_exception_only: 0.9983\n493\t    sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp: 3.3\n494\t    gpt4o_api_cost_usd: 2.5\n495\t    sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n496\t    cost_ratio: 250\n497\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定\n498\t    exception_only traces，task 简化为 ''if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no\n499\t    errors → likely pass''。 Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自：\n500\t    (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导， 与\n501\t    SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合； (3) 对 no_exception\n502\t    format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete information 而非 no-fault signal）。\n503\t    3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立 consistent\n504\t    decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了 dataset-specific patterns（哪些\n505\t    exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot 的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail\n506\t    patterns。 关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot\n507\t    (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic\n508\t    reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 ''modest''——需要强调 error count 差异（2 vs ~42\n509\t    errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。 GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT\n510\t    no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model 的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only\n511\t    (99.83%)。\n512\t\n513\t    '\n514\t  tables:\n515\t  - title: SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\n516\t    headers:\n517\t    - Method\n518\t    - Model\n519\t    - Input\n520\t    - Accuracy\n521\t    - Errors/1190\n522\t    - Cost ($)\n523\t    - Latency\n524\t    rows:\n525\t    - - SFT\n526\t      - Qwen-7B\n527\t      - exception_only\n528\t      - 99.83%\n529\t      - 2\n530\t      - ~$0.01\n531\t      - ~2s batch\n532\t    - - SFT\n533\t      - Qwen-1.5B\n534\t      - exception_only\n535\t      - 99.83%\n536\t      - 2\n537\t      - ~$0.005\n538\t      - ~1s batch\n539\t    - - 3-shot\n540\t      - GPT-4o\n541\t      - exception_only\n542\t      - 96.5%\n543\t      - ~42\n544\t      - ~$2.50\n545\t      - ~15min serial\n546\t    - - 3-shot\n547\t      - Claude\n548\t      - exception_only\n549\t      - 96.0%\n550\t      - ~48\n551\t      - ~$3.00\n552\t      - ~18min serial\n553\t    - - 0-shot\n554\t      - GPT-4o\n555\t      - exception_only\n556\t      - 94.5%\n557\t      - ~65\n558\t      - ~$1.80\n559\t      - ~12min serial\n560\t    - - 0-shot\n561\t      - Claude\n562\t      - exception_only\n563\t      - 93.5%\n564\t      - ~77\n565\t      - ~$2.20\n566\t      - ~14min serial\n567\t    - - 3-shot\n568\t      - GPT-4o\n569\t      - no_trace\n570\t      - 83.5%\n571\t      - ~196\n572\t      - ~$1.20\n573\t      - ~10min serial\n574\t  - title: Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\n575\t    headers:\n576\t    - Model\n577\t    - Params\n578\t    - 0-shot\n579\t    - 3-shot\n580\t    - SFT\n581\t    - SFT Δ vs 3-shot\n582\t    rows:\n583\t    - - Qwen-1.5B\n584\t      - 1.5B\n585\t      - 93.45%\n586\t      - —\n587\t      - 99.83%\n588\t      - +6.4pp\n589\t    - - Qwen-7B\n590\t      - 7B\n591\t      - 89.08%\n592\t      - 90.84%\n593\t      - 99.83%\n594\t      - +9.0pp\n595\t    - - DeepSeek-7B\n596\t      - 6.7B\n597\t      - 90.59%\n598\t      - —\n599\t      - 99.33%\n600\t      - +8.7pp\n601\t    - - GPT-4o\n602\t      - '>175B'\n603\t      - 94.5%\n604\t      - 96.5%\n605\t      - —\n606\t      - —\n607\t    - - Claude\n608\t      - '>175B'\n609\t      - 93.5%\n610\t      - 96.0%\n611\t      - —\n612\t      - —\n613\t  figures_description:\n614\t  - 'Bar chart: accuracy by method (SFT exception_only × 4 models, 0-shot × 5 models,\n615\t    3-shot × 2 frontier models)。SFT bars 在 99%+ 区域，few-shot bars 在 90-97% 区域，清晰展示\n616\t    SFT advantage。'\n617\t  - 'Cost-accuracy Pareto plot: x-axis = log(cost per 1190 samples), y-axis = accuracy。SFT\n618\t    在左上角 (low cost, high accuracy), frontier few-shot 在右下 (high cost, lower accuracy)。'\n619\t  analysis: 'Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越\n620\t    frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT model\n621\t    超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model 也从 exception\n622\t    traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent confirm Claim\n623\t    2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能 argue ''the gap is not\n624\t    practically significant given the cost of SFT''。Rebuttal： (a) error count 差异是\n625\t    21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大； (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c)\n626\t    SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需 API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为\n627\t    ''SFT as practical deployment recommendation'' 而非 ''SFT is fundamentally superior''。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t- name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n631\t  plan_id: plan_021\n632\t  description: 不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    python_ood_exception_only_accuracy: 0.965\n635\t    python_ood_exception_only_ci:\n636\t    - 0.945\n637\t    - 0.98\n638\t    python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp: 3.3\n639\t    java_exception_only_accuracy: 0.92\n640\t    java_exception_only_ci:\n641\t    - 0.895\n642\t    - 0.945\n643\t    java_degradation_vs_id_pp: 7.8\n644\t    javascript_exception_only_accuracy: 0.905\n645\t    javascript_exception_only_ci:\n646\t    - 0.875\n647\t    - 0.93\n648\t    javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp: 9.3\n649\t    cross_language_mean_accuracy: 0.93\n650\t    cross_language_mean_degradation_pp: 6.8\n651\t    python_ood_no_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n652\t    java_no_trace_accuracy: 0.68\n653\t    javascript_no_trace_accuracy: 0.67\n654\t    exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp: 24.3\n655\t  result_rationale: 'Exception_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language\n656\t    structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer output 的\n657\t    design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception type naming 和 error\n658\t    message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。 Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception\n659\t    types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError） 与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions\n660\t    造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation 主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的\n661\t    test structure 差异（多文件、fixtures）。 Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch,\n662\t    stack traces）但 exception type names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException\n663\t    等 Java-specific names 训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception\n664\t    type 的 fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。 JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error\n665\t    handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError in async context），且 error message format\n666\t    与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的 presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp\n667\t    degradation。 所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception\n668\t    signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\n669\t\n670\t    '\n671\t  tables:\n672\t  - title: 'OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages'\n673\t    headers:\n674\t    - Language\n675\t    - Setting\n676\t    - exception_only\n677\t    - no_trace\n678\t    - Lift\n679\t    - Degradation vs in-domain\n680\t    rows:\n681\t    - - Python\n682\t      - In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP)\n683\t      - 99.83%\n684\t      - 75.1%\n685\t      - +24.7pp\n686\t      - baseline\n687\t    - - Python\n688\t      - OOD (new projects)\n689\t      - 96.5%\n690\t      - 72.0%\n691\t      - +24.5pp\n692\t      - -3.3pp\n693\t    - - Java\n694\t      - OOD\n695\t      - 92.0%\n696\t      - 68.0%\n697\t      - +24.0pp\n698\t      - -7.8pp\n699\t    - - JavaScript\n700\t      - OOD\n701\t      - 90.5%\n702\t      - 67.0%\n703\t      - +23.5pp\n704\t      - -9.3pp\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: languages × conditions (exception_only vs no_trace)。每种语言两个\n707\t    bar，展示 exception_only 的 lift 在 OOD 上保持稳定 (~24pp)，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。'\n708\t  - 'Degradation waterfall: in-domain → Python OOD → Java → JavaScript，展示 progressive\n709\t    degradation 但 floor 仍 >90%。'\n710\t  analysis: 'OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization claim。Java/JavaScript\n711\t    降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions， (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明\n712\t    exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy\n713\t    受 token-level distribution shift 影响。论文 framing：''exception_only generalizes within-language\n714\t    with minimal degradation (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp);\n715\t    the diagnostic signal advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language''。审稿人可能\n716\t    argue ''Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic''——rebuttal：降级来自\n717\t    exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed training\n718\t    可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task 多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果\n719\t    Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\n720\t\n721\t    '\n722\t- name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n723\t  plan_id: plan_022\n724\t  description: exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\n725\t  expected_results:\n726\t    exception_only_steps_to_90pct: 30\n727\t    exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 50\n728\t    exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 120\n729\t    exception_only_final_accuracy: 0.9983\n730\t    exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n731\t    vota_steps_to_90pct: 60\n732\t    vota_steps_to_95pct: 100\n733\t    vota_steps_to_99pct: 180\n734\t    vota_final_accuracy: 0.9941\n735\t    vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n736\t    full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 150\n737\t    full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.83\n738\t    full_trace_peak_step: 200\n739\t    full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.8176\n740\t    full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_with_dip\n741\t    no_trace_steps_to_73pct: 80\n742\t    no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n743\t    no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n744\t    speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct: 2.0\n745\t    speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct: 5.0\n746\t    exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain: 8.5\n747\t    full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain: 72.0\n748\t    efficiency_ratio: 8.5\n749\t  result_rationale: 'Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency\n750\t    的影响。 Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens）， gradient\n751\t    完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal 的 binary structure（有\n752\t    exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量 样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens\n753\t    干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。 Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000\n754\t    tokens）导致 gradient dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2)\n755\t    epoch1 peak (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict\n756\t    signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation\n757\t    而非 systematic learning。 VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要\n758\t    更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。 No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict\n759\t    的弱统计相关性。 Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct\n760\t    quantification： exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要\n761\t    ~72——验证 ''denser signal → faster learning'' 的因果链。\n762\t\n763\t    '\n764\t  tables:\n765\t  - title: Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\n766\t    headers:\n767\t    - Condition\n768\t    - To 80%\n769\t    - To 90%\n770\t    - To 95%\n771\t    - To 99%\n772\t    - Final\n773\t    - Shape\n774\t    rows:\n775\t    - - exception_only\n776\t      - ~20\n777\t      - ~30\n778\t      - ~50\n779\t      - ~120\n780\t      - 99.83%\n781\t      - Rapid saturation\n782\t    - - VOTA\n783\t      - ~30\n784\t      - ~60\n785\t      - ~100\n786\t      - ~180\n787\t      - 99.41%\n788\t      - Moderate saturation\n789\t    - - full_trace\n790\t      - ~150\n791\t      - never\n792\t      - never\n793\t      - never\n794\t      - 81.76%\n795\t      - Non-monotonic\n796\t    - - no_trace\n797\t      - never\n798\t      - never\n799\t      - never\n800\t      - never\n801\t      - 75.13%\n802\t      - Low-ceiling plateau\n803\t  - title: Learning Efficiency Comparison\n804\t    headers:\n805\t    - Condition\n806\t    - Effective unique samples\n807\t    - Final lift (pp)\n808\t    - Samples per pp\n809\t    - Efficiency\n810\t    rows:\n811\t    - - exception_only\n812\t      - 2858\n813\t      - 24.7\n814\t      - 8.5\n815\t      - 1.0× (reference)\n816\t    - - VOTA\n817\t      - ~5800\n818\t      - 24.3\n819\t      - 17.5\n820\t      - 0.49×\n821\t    - - full_trace\n822\t      - ~5800\n823\t      - 6.6\n824\t      - 71.8\n825\t      - 0.12×\n826\t    - - no_trace\n827\t      - ~5800\n828\t      - 3.6\n829\t      - 131.7\n830\t      - 0.06×\n831\t  figures_description:\n832\t  - 'Learning curve plot (main figure): x-axis = training steps, y-axis = eval accuracy\n833\t    (%)。4 条 curves 用不同颜色/线型。exception_only 陡升后 flat（红色实线），VOTA 次之（蓝色实线），full_trace\n834\t    non-monotonic（绿色虚线），no_trace 低 plateau（灰色点线）。水平虚线标注 majority baseline (71.5%)。每\n835\t    50 steps 一个评估点。'\n836\t  - 'Convergence speed bar chart: 4 conditions × steps to reach 90% (或 condition-specific\n837\t    ceiling 的 90%)，直观对比 learning speed。exception_only bar 最短。'\n838\t  analysis: Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充\n839\t    已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only\n840\t    不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than full_trace，直接量化了\n841\t    information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve（epoch2\n842\t    dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling， 还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss\n843\t    vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。 论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve\n844\t    (plan_016) 形成 互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics\n845\t    展示 'how efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim\n846\t    2 的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only has shorter\n847\t    sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration， 两者 confounded\n848\t    但都支持 information density narrative。\n849\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca021833-68ad-48d2-8c47-9a2b5434c32f","uuid":"30c2321e-dd99-4b50-a2ef-887cf3f6e31b","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:24:26.632Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T113804/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Median 档结果总结：7 个 planned 实验全部符合 ''pattern exists but model-dependent''\n  预期。 plan_016 (tail-384) 确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 分化为两组——强模型 (Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B)\n  gradual，弱模型 (DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B) sharp——''universal sharp phase transition'' 降级为\n  ''consistent trend with model-dependent transition characteristics''。plan_017 (cross-seed)\n  std 范围 0.4-3.5pp 证明 budget curve reproducible 但 variance 与模型强度相关。plan_019 确认 exception_only\n  near-perfect calibration 跨 4 模型通用（非离群 ECE ≤ 0.01）。plan_020 确认 SFT 优于 frontier model\n  few-shot 3-5pp，支持 SFT practical recommendation 但非压倒性优势。 plan_018 和 plan_022 提供 supporting\n  evidence 但不升级任何 claim。plan_021 是最大风险——跨语言 泛化可能大幅降级。总体：Claim 1 + Claim 3 核心证据不受影响，budget\n  curve 保留为 supporting evidence， EMNLP main 有竞争力 (P≈0.35-0.45) 但 scope concern + model-dependent\n  phase transition 需 strong rebuttal。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.855\n    qwen7b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.832\n    - 0.877\n    qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.6\n    qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -8.1\n    qwen7b_transition_type: gradual\n    deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.805\n    deepseek_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.781\n    - 0.829\n    deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 4.1\n    deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -13.4\n    deepseek_transition_type: sharp\n    qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.79\n    qwen15b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.765\n    - 0.815\n    qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.4\n    qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -16.6\n    qwen15b_transition_type: sharp\n    codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.875\n    codellama13b_tail384_ci:\n    - 0.854\n    - 0.896\n    codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n    codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -10.0\n    codellama13b_transition_type: gradual\n    four_model_mean: 0.831\n    sharp_models_mean: 0.798\n    gradual_models_mean: 0.865\n    max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n  result_rationale: 'tail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384\n    能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因： (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B\n    CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception 信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384\n    tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition； (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B\n    仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512\n    区间——呈 sharp transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer\n    差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace reasoning\n    能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小， loss landscape 更陡峭，384\n    tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)'\n    headers:\n    - Model\n    - tail-256 (%)\n    - tail-384 (%)\n    - tail-512 (%)\n    - tail-1024 (%)\n    - tail-2048 (%)\n    - Δ(256→384)\n    - Δ(384→512)\n    - Transition\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - 78.9\n      - 85.5\n      - 93.6\n      - 96.5\n      - 97.3\n      - +6.6pp\n      - +8.1pp\n      - Gradual\n    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n      - 76.4\n      - 80.5\n      - 93.9\n      - 96.5\n      - 95.0\n      - +4.1pp\n      - +13.4pp\n      - Sharp\n    - - Qwen-1.5B\n      - 72.6\n      - 79.0\n      - 95.6\n      - 96.6\n      - 97.9\n      - +6.4pp\n      - +16.6pp\n      - Sharp\n    - - CodeLlama-13B\n      - 77.9\n      - 87.5\n      - 97.5\n      - 98.2\n      - collapse\n      - +9.6pp\n      - +10.0pp\n      - Gradual\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Budget curve figure (4-panel or overlay): x-axis = tail token budget [256, 384,\n    512, 1024, 2048], y-axis = accuracy (%)。4 条模型曲线，384 处标注 transition type。Gradual\n    模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama）曲线在 256→512 段近似线性上升；Sharp 模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）曲线在 256→384\n    段平缓、384→512 段陡升，呈 S 型。水平虚线标注 exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。'\n  - 'Transition sharpness scatter: x-axis = model capability proxy (CRUXEval-I 或 param\n    count), y-axis = Δ(384-256)/Δ(512-256) ratio (越高越 gradual)。4 点+回归线，展示 capability→gradualness\n    正相关。'\n  analysis: 'tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。\n    两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。 这直接影响论文\n    claim：不能说 ''universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens''，需降级为 ''consistent\n    accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics: stronger\n    models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds''。 积极面：4-model\n    mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含 有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512\n    均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增\n    model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness 与 model capability 的相关性分析。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band\n    robustness\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b_seed42: 0.936\n    qwen7b_seed123: 0.924\n    qwen7b_seed456: 0.943\n    qwen7b_mean: 0.934\n    qwen7b_std_pp: 1.0\n    deepseek_seed42: 0.939\n    deepseek_seed123: 0.885\n    deepseek_seed456: 0.942\n    deepseek_mean: 0.922\n    deepseek_std_pp: 3.2\n    qwen15b_seed42: 0.956\n    qwen15b_seed123: 0.9\n    qwen15b_seed456: 0.938\n    qwen15b_mean: 0.931\n    qwen15b_std_pp: 2.9\n    codellama13b_seed42: 0.975\n    codellama13b_seed123: 0.968\n    codellama13b_seed456: 0.978\n    codellama13b_mean: 0.974\n    codellama13b_std_pp: 0.5\n    max_std_across_models_pp: 3.2\n    strong_model_avg_std_pp: 0.75\n    weak_model_avg_std_pp: 3.05\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning\n    稳定性。 逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量 赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B,\n    CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到 类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek,\n    Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape 更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity\n    (seed123=91.09% vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的\n    noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank 相对于\n    total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其 exception_only seed123\n    (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。 CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp)\n    因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512 的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\n    headers:\n    - Model\n    - Seed42\n    - Seed123\n    - Seed456\n    - Mean\n    - Std\n    - Band Width\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - 93.6%\n      - 92.4%\n      - 94.3%\n      - 93.4%\n      - 1.0pp\n      - 1.9pp\n    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n      - 93.9%\n      - 88.5%\n      - 94.2%\n      - 92.2%\n      - 3.2pp\n      - 5.7pp\n    - - Qwen-1.5B\n      - 95.6%\n      - 90.0%\n      - 93.8%\n      - 93.1%\n      - 2.9pp\n      - 5.6pp\n    - - CodeLlama-13B\n      - 97.5%\n      - 96.8%\n      - 97.8%\n      - 97.4%\n      - 0.5pp\n      - 1.0pp\n  - title: Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\n    headers:\n    - Group\n    - Models\n    - Avg Std\n    - Avg Band Width\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Strong\n      - Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\n      - 0.75pp\n      - 1.5pp\n      - 'Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth'\n    - - Weak\n      - DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\n      - 3.05pp\n      - 5.7pp\n      - 'Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Band plot: x-axis = tail token budget, y-axis = accuracy。每个模型一条中线 (mean) + shaded\n    band (min-max across 3 seeds)。强模型 band 窄，弱模型 band 宽。在 tail-512 处用 error bar 标注\n    3-seed CI。'\n  - 'Seed variance vs model capability scatter: x-axis = CRUXEval-I (或 param count\n    log scale), y-axis = tail-512 3-seed std (pp)。4 点 + power fit，展示 capability↑ →\n    variance↓ 趋势。'\n  analysis: 'Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在\n    92-97% 区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须 使用的\n    hedged language：不能说 ''tail-512 reliably achieves >93%''，需改为 ''tail-512 mean accuracy\n    ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models (std < 1pp) and\n    wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)''。审稿人问 ''single-seed robustness'' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明\n    budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 > tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256)\n    在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust； absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA\n    training 问题而非 signal 问题——与 exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier\n    1 vs Tier 2 差异\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_exception_only_errors: 2\n    qwen_exception_only_error_ids:\n    - 901\n    - 905\n    qwen_exception_only_root_cause: 100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\n    qwen_exception_only_error_direction: 100% pass→fail false alarm\n    qwen_vota_errors: 7\n    qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n    qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors: 3\n    qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors: 2\n    qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio: 0.57\n    qwen_full_trace_errors: 217\n    qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.35\n    qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.08\n    qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.65\n    qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r: 0.42\n    qwen_no_trace_errors: 296\n    qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.63\n    qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction: 0.37\n    deepseek_seed123_errors: 106\n    deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.72\n    deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible: 2\n    exception_only_cross_model_jaccard: 0.85\n    full_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.15\n    no_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.25\n  result_rationale: 'Error analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure\n    modes： (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer\n    设计 缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/ representation\n    property 而非 model property。 (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression\n    有时产生误导性 摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接\n    支持 Claim 3 的 ''combining tiers introduces noise'' 论点。 (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace\n    长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35% vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload\n    pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%）， 说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority\n    class。 (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。 (5) DeepSeek\n    seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致—— LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail\n    映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\n    headers:\n    - Condition\n    - Total Errors\n    - fail→pass (%)\n    - pass→fail (%)\n    - Dominant Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - 2\n      - 0%\n      - 100%\n      - GeneratorExit irreducible\n    - - VOTA\n      - 7\n      - 57%\n      - 43%\n      - Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\n    - - full_trace\n      - 217\n      - 65%\n      - 35%\n      - Information overload (length-correlated)\n    - - no_trace\n      - 296\n      - 63%\n      - 37%\n      - Majority class bias\n  - title: Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\n    headers:\n    - Length Bucket\n    - N Samples\n    - Errors\n    - Error Rate\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - <500 tokens\n      - ~180\n      - ~14\n      - ~8%\n      - 'Short traces: fault signal accessible'\n    - - 500-1000 tokens\n      - ~350\n      - ~56\n      - ~16%\n      - 'Medium: partial signal loss'\n    - - 1000-1500 tokens\n      - ~380\n      - ~76\n      - ~20%\n      - 'Long: significant overload'\n    - - '>1500 tokens'\n      - ~280\n      - ~98\n      - ~35%\n      - 'Very long: severe information overload'\n  - title: Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\n    headers:\n    - Model Pair\n    - Jaccard\n    - Shared Errors\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\n      - 0.9\n      - 2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\n      - Same representation → same irreducible errors\n    - - Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\n      - 0.8\n      - 2/~2.5 avg\n      - Different tokenizer but same root cause\n    - - Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\n      - 0.22\n      - 2/~10\n      - DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Confusion matrix grid (2×4): 4 conditions × Qwen-7B，展示 error direction 差异。exception_only\n    和 VOTA 几乎完美（极少 off-diagonal），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail→pass 偏移。'\n  - 'Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace only): x-axis = input token count,\n    y-axis = binary correct/incorrect，加 binned error rate 趋势线。展示 information overload\n    的 dose-response 关系。'\n  - 'Venn diagram: exception_only vs VOTA 错误重叠（Qwen-7B），展示 VOTA 额外错误全来自 Tier 2 noise。'\n  analysis: 'Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible error\n    来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0）， 强化 ''99.83% =\n    ceiling'' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components， 直接 quantify 了 ''combining\n    tiers introduces noise'' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误 与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2\n    information overload 假说的 direct evidence。 不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为\n    expected follow-up）， 但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary\n    或 Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: 4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\n  expected_results:\n    qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n    qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n    qwen7b_accuracy: 0.9983\n    qwen15b_ece: 0.003\n    qwen15b_brier: 0.0015\n    qwen15b_accuracy: 0.9983\n    codellama13b_ece: 0.002\n    codellama13b_brier: 0.001\n    codellama13b_accuracy: 0.9983\n    deepseek_seed42_ece: 0.008\n    deepseek_seed42_brier: 0.005\n    deepseek_seed42_accuracy: 0.9933\n    deepseek_seed123_ece: 0.085\n    deepseek_seed123_brier: 0.075\n    deepseek_seed123_accuracy: 0.9109\n    four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.008\n    four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max: 0.005\n    ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min: 21.0\n    ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max: 85.5\n  result_rationale: 'Calibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅\n    2 个 相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit confidence\n    接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列\n    tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration 差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B\n    参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。 DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors)\n    的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着 更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek\n    seed123 (91.09%) 是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence\n    pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE 均 ≤ 0.008，与\n    no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal 不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally\n    improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Cross-model Calibration: exception_only'\n    headers:\n    - Model\n    - Accuracy\n    - ECE\n    - Brier\n    - ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\n    - Notes\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.0027\n      - 0.0013\n      - 63×\n      - 3-seed confirmed; existing data\n    - - Qwen-1.5B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.0015\n      - 57×\n      - Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\n    - - CodeLlama-13B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.002\n      - 0.001\n      - 86×\n      - Largest model → sharpest calibration\n    - - DeepSeek (seed42/456)\n      - 99.33%\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.005\n      - 21×\n      - 8 errors; still excellent\n    - - DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\n      - 91.09%\n      - 0.085\n      - 0.075\n      - 2×\n      - LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Reliability diagram (4-panel): 每个模型一个 calibration curve (predicted prob vs actual\n    frequency)。3 个非离群模型的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration 对角线重合；DeepSeek seed123 curve 偏离对角线（overconfident\n    on pass predictions for actual-fail samples）。'\n  - 'ECE bar chart: 4 models × exception_only + Qwen-7B no_trace/full_trace/VOTA 作对照。exception_only\n    的 bar 在所有模型上极短（≤0.008），no_trace bar (0.171) 显著突出。'\n  analysis: 'Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal\n    property 而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：''exception_only achieves near-perfect\n    calibration (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement\n    over no-trace baselines''。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem\n    而非 calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值： calibration\n    是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83% 可能 saturated，ECE/Brier\n    提供模型 ''knows what it knows'' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2 或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与\n    accuracy table 并列。\n\n    '\n- name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_0shot_exception_only: 0.945\n    gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.93\n    - 0.96\n    gpt4o_3shot_exception_only: 0.965\n    gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.95\n    - 0.98\n    claude_0shot_exception_only: 0.935\n    claude_0shot_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.92\n    - 0.95\n    claude_3shot_exception_only: 0.96\n    claude_3shot_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.945\n    - 0.975\n    gpt4o_3shot_no_trace: 0.835\n    claude_3shot_no_trace: 0.82\n    sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n    sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp: 3.3\n    sft_qwen15b_exception_only: 0.9983\n    sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp: 3.3\n    gpt4o_api_cost_usd: 2.5\n    sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n    cost_ratio: 250\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定\n    exception_only traces，task 简化为 ''if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no\n    errors → likely pass''。 Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自：\n    (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导， 与\n    SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合； (3) 对 no_exception\n    format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete information 而非 no-fault signal）。\n    3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立 consistent\n    decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了 dataset-specific patterns（哪些\n    exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot 的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail\n    patterns。 关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot\n    (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic\n    reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 ''modest''——需要强调 error count 差异（2 vs ~42\n    errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。 GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT\n    no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model 的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only\n    (99.83%)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\n    headers:\n    - Method\n    - Model\n    - Input\n    - Accuracy\n    - Errors/1190\n    - Cost ($)\n    - Latency\n    rows:\n    - - SFT\n      - Qwen-7B\n      - exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - ~$0.01\n      - ~2s batch\n    - - SFT\n      - Qwen-1.5B\n      - exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - ~$0.005\n      - ~1s batch\n    - - 3-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - exception_only\n      - 96.5%\n      - ~42\n      - ~$2.50\n      - ~15min serial\n    - - 3-shot\n      - Claude\n      - exception_only\n      - 96.0%\n      - ~48\n      - ~$3.00\n      - ~18min serial\n    - - 0-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - exception_only\n      - 94.5%\n      - ~65\n      - ~$1.80\n      - ~12min serial\n    - - 0-shot\n      - Claude\n      - exception_only\n      - 93.5%\n      - ~77\n      - ~$2.20\n      - ~14min serial\n    - - 3-shot\n      - GPT-4o\n      - no_trace\n      - 83.5%\n      - ~196\n      - ~$1.20\n      - ~10min serial\n  - title: Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\n    headers:\n    - Model\n    - Params\n    - 0-shot\n    - 3-shot\n    - SFT\n    - SFT Δ vs 3-shot\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-1.5B\n      - 1.5B\n      - 93.45%\n      - —\n      - 99.83%\n      - +6.4pp\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - 7B\n      - 89.08%\n      - 90.84%\n      - 99.83%\n      - +9.0pp\n    - - DeepSeek-7B\n      - 6.7B\n      - 90.59%\n      - —\n      - 99.33%\n      - +8.7pp\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - '>175B'\n      - 94.5%\n      - 96.5%\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Claude\n      - '>175B'\n      - 93.5%\n      - 96.0%\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: accuracy by method (SFT exception_only × 4 models, 0-shot × 5 models,\n    3-shot × 2 frontier models)。SFT bars 在 99%+ 区域，few-shot bars 在 90-97% 区域，清晰展示\n    SFT advantage。'\n  - 'Cost-accuracy Pareto plot: x-axis = log(cost per 1190 samples), y-axis = accuracy。SFT\n    在左上角 (low cost, high accuracy), frontier few-shot 在右下 (high cost, lower accuracy)。'\n  analysis: 'Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越\n    frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT model\n    超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model 也从 exception\n    traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent confirm Claim\n    2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能 argue ''the gap is not\n    practically significant given the cost of SFT''。Rebuttal： (a) error count 差异是\n    21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大； (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c)\n    SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需 API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为\n    ''SFT as practical deployment recommendation'' 而非 ''SFT is fundamentally superior''。\n\n    '\n- name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: 不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\n  expected_results:\n    python_ood_exception_only_accuracy: 0.965\n    python_ood_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.945\n    - 0.98\n    python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp: 3.3\n    java_exception_only_accuracy: 0.92\n    java_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.895\n    - 0.945\n    java_degradation_vs_id_pp: 7.8\n    javascript_exception_only_accuracy: 0.905\n    javascript_exception_only_ci:\n    - 0.875\n    - 0.93\n    javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp: 9.3\n    cross_language_mean_accuracy: 0.93\n    cross_language_mean_degradation_pp: 6.8\n    python_ood_no_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n    java_no_trace_accuracy: 0.68\n    javascript_no_trace_accuracy: 0.67\n    exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp: 24.3\n  result_rationale: 'Exception_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language\n    structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer output 的\n    design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception type naming 和 error\n    message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。 Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception\n    types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError） 与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions\n    造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation 主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的\n    test structure 差异（多文件、fixtures）。 Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch,\n    stack traces）但 exception type names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException\n    等 Java-specific names 训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception\n    type 的 fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。 JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error\n    handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError in async context），且 error message format\n    与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的 presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp\n    degradation。 所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception\n    signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages'\n    headers:\n    - Language\n    - Setting\n    - exception_only\n    - no_trace\n    - Lift\n    - Degradation vs in-domain\n    rows:\n    - - Python\n      - In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP)\n      - 99.83%\n      - 75.1%\n      - +24.7pp\n      - baseline\n    - - Python\n      - OOD (new projects)\n      - 96.5%\n      - 72.0%\n      - +24.5pp\n      - -3.3pp\n    - - Java\n      - OOD\n      - 92.0%\n      - 68.0%\n      - +24.0pp\n      - -7.8pp\n    - - JavaScript\n      - OOD\n      - 90.5%\n      - 67.0%\n      - +23.5pp\n      - -9.3pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: languages × conditions (exception_only vs no_trace)。每种语言两个\n    bar，展示 exception_only 的 lift 在 OOD 上保持稳定 (~24pp)，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。'\n  - 'Degradation waterfall: in-domain → Python OOD → Java → JavaScript，展示 progressive\n    degradation 但 floor 仍 >90%。'\n  analysis: 'OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization claim。Java/JavaScript\n    降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions， (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明\n    exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy\n    受 token-level distribution shift 影响。论文 framing：''exception_only generalizes within-language\n    with minimal degradation (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp);\n    the diagnostic signal advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language''。审稿人可能\n    argue ''Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic''——rebuttal：降级来自\n    exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed training\n    可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task 多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果\n    Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\n\n    '\n- name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\n  expected_results:\n    exception_only_steps_to_90pct: 30\n    exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 50\n    exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 120\n    exception_only_final_accuracy: 0.9983\n    exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n    vota_steps_to_90pct: 60\n    vota_steps_to_95pct: 100\n    vota_steps_to_99pct: 180\n    vota_final_accuracy: 0.9941\n    vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n    full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 150\n    full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.83\n    full_trace_peak_step: 200\n    full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.8176\n    full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_with_dip\n    no_trace_steps_to_73pct: 80\n    no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n    no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n    speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct: 2.0\n    speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct: 5.0\n    exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain: 8.5\n    full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain: 72.0\n    efficiency_ratio: 8.5\n  result_rationale: 'Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency\n    的影响。 Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens）， gradient\n    完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal 的 binary structure（有\n    exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量 样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens\n    干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。 Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000\n    tokens）导致 gradient dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2)\n    epoch1 peak (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict\n    signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation\n    而非 systematic learning。 VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要\n    更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。 No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict\n    的弱统计相关性。 Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct\n    quantification： exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要\n    ~72——验证 ''denser signal → faster learning'' 的因果链。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\n    headers:\n    - Condition\n    - To 80%\n    - To 90%\n    - To 95%\n    - To 99%\n    - Final\n    - Shape\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - ~20\n      - ~30\n      - ~50\n      - ~120\n      - 99.83%\n      - Rapid saturation\n    - - VOTA\n      - ~30\n      - ~60\n      - ~100\n      - ~180\n      - 99.41%\n      - Moderate saturation\n    - - full_trace\n      - ~150\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - 81.76%\n      - Non-monotonic\n    - - no_trace\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - never\n      - 75.13%\n      - Low-ceiling plateau\n  - title: Learning Efficiency Comparison\n    headers:\n    - Condition\n    - Effective unique samples\n    - Final lift (pp)\n    - Samples per pp\n    - Efficiency\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - 2858\n      - 24.7\n      - 8.5\n      - 1.0× (reference)\n    - - VOTA\n      - ~5800\n      - 24.3\n      - 17.5\n      - 0.49×\n    - - full_trace\n      - ~5800\n      - 6.6\n      - 71.8\n      - 0.12×\n    - - no_trace\n      - ~5800\n      - 3.6\n      - 131.7\n      - 0.06×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Learning curve plot (main figure): x-axis = training steps, y-axis = eval accuracy\n    (%)。4 条 curves 用不同颜色/线型。exception_only 陡升后 flat（红色实线），VOTA 次之（蓝色实线），full_trace\n    non-monotonic（绿色虚线），no_trace 低 plateau（灰色点线）。水平虚线标注 majority baseline (71.5%)。每\n    50 steps 一个评估点。'\n  - 'Convergence speed bar chart: 4 conditions × steps to reach 90% (或 condition-specific\n    ceiling 的 90%)，直观对比 learning speed。exception_only bar 最短。'\n  analysis: Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充\n    已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only\n    不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than full_trace，直接量化了\n    information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve（epoch2\n    dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling， 还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss\n    vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。 论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve\n    (plan_016) 形成 互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics\n    展示 'how efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim\n    2 的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only has shorter\n    sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration， 两者 confounded\n    但都支持 information density narrative。\n","numLines":849,"startLine":1,"totalLines":849}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01R6WTK7wLxfjsvd9QqvANpb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now reviewed the existing dream report for the median tier and the experiment plan. The existing dream report has already been generated for the same median tier definition. The user is asking me to generate a new version — likely a refreshed/updated version based on the current state of the project.\n\nLet me compare: the existing median report was from dream_20260518T113804, which is quite recent (today is 2026-05-18). The user's Phase 1 definition is consistent with what was used before.\n\nHowever, the user is asking me to generate fresh predictions. Let me read the existing report fully, check all the data points, and then produce my own version. \n\nI need to pull the most current data from the registry and paper_framing to ensure accuracy. Looking at the existing report, I see it predicts certain models as \"sharp\" performers (like DeepSeek tail-384 at 80.5% and Qwen-1.5B at 79.0%) while others show \"gradual\" curves (Qwen-7B at 85.5% and CodeLlama at 87.5%), creating a two-group pattern. But the median tier definition suggests a different range, so I should verify whether these predictions align with the actual tier boundaries or if I need to adjust them based on the current data. Now I'm working through the specific models to verify they fit the median tier definition. For Qwen-7B and DeepSeek, the sharpness values around 0.45-0.50 place tail-384 right in the expected 83-89% range. Qwen-1.5B comes in slightly low at 82.5%, so I'm adjusting the sharpness coefficient to 0.46 to push it up to 83% and align with the range.\n\nCodeLlama-13B lands at 88.3%, which is solid. Looking at all four models together, the mean is 85.35% with a standard deviation of 2.23 percentage points—well within the acceptable bounds. The sharpness indices cluster between 0.43 and 0.53, comfortably within the allowed range. Everything checks out, so I'm ready to generate the YAML output with these refined values.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21729,"cache_read_input_tokens":83511,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21729},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca021833-68ad-48d2-8c47-9a2b5434c32f","uuid":"8646340a-168c-42af-80bc-0c9507611d0b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01R6WTK7wLxfjsvd9QqvANpb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full context. Let me verify the tail budget curve anchor data precisely, then generate the predictions.\n\nKey existing tail data for calibration:\n- **Qwen-7B**: tail-256=77.5%, tail-512=93.6%, tail-1024=96.5%, tail-2048=97.3%\n- **DeepSeek**: tail-256=76.4%, tail-512=93.9%, tail-1024=96.5%, tail-2048=95.0%\n- **Qwen-1.5B**: tail-256=72.6%, tail-512=95.6%, tail-1024=96.6%, tail-2048=97.9%\n- **CodeLlama-13B**: tail-256=77.9%, tail-512=97.5%, tail-1024=98.2%, tail-2048=collapsed\n\nNote: the prior dream report (dream_20260518T113804) incorrectly split models into \"sharp vs gradual\" groups, contradicting the median tier definition which specifies \"tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%, transition 是 smooth gradient 非 sharp boundary\". I'll correct this.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 从 'phase transition in trace informativeness' 改为 'diagnostic signal concentrates\n  in trace tail with diminishing returns; information density — not gradient dilution —\n  is the primary bottleneck'。tail-384 在四模型上均落在 256→512 的 43-53% 位置（83-88%），\n  确认 smooth gradient 而非 sharp boundary。Budget curve 四模型趋势一致（log-shaped \n  diminishing returns），但无共同拐点——每个模型的 steepest gain 区间长度和位置略有不同。\n  Budget curve 从 standalone finding 降为 supporting figure，label_only 26/74 分解升为 \n  Claim 2 sole quantitative evidence。补偿措施: (a) tail-512≫head-2048（~94% vs ~79%, \n  Δ≈15pp）作为 information locality 的 strong evidence；(b) exception_only scale invariance\n  （1.5B=7B=13B=99.83%）提升至更高叙事位置；(c) cross-model calibration (plan_019, 1h) + \n  error analysis (plan_018, 0h) 增加独立 evidence 维度。cross-seed σ~1-3pp 不否定趋势但\n  削弱 point estimate 精度，所有 budget curve 数字需附 uncertainty band。仍冲 Main，\n  Findings 作 fallback。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 models，精确定位 256→512 区间 transition 形态\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.856\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.835, 0.877]\n      qwen7b_sharpness_index: 0.52\n      deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.843\n      deepseek_tail384_ci: [0.821, 0.865]\n      deepseek_sharpness_index: 0.46\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.832\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.808, 0.854]\n      qwen15b_sharpness_index: 0.44\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.883\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.863, 0.903]\n      codellama13b_sharpness_index: 0.54\n      four_model_mean: 0.854\n      four_model_std_pp: 2.23\n      mean_sharpness_index: 0.49\n      all_models_gradual: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档定义 tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%，transition 为 smooth gradient。\n      推导逻辑：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾（crash point + stack trace），\n      tail-256 捕获 assertion 结果和 traceback 尾部但常截断中段 context；tail-384 \n      额外覆盖约 128 tokens 的 traceback context（调用栈前几帧、变量快照），提供 \n      incremental 而非 step-function 式的信息增益。四模型 sharpness index 均在 \n      0.44-0.54 范围（center 0.49，几乎正好 midpoint），没有模型出现 <0.3（sharp \n      stay at 256 level）或 >0.7（sharp jump to 512 level）。CodeLlama-13B 略高 \n      （0.54）因 13B 参数量更有效利用 partial exception context；Qwen-1.5B 略低 \n      （0.44）因小模型从 partial signal 中提取信息的效率较低。但差异幅度仅 0.10，\n      不足以形成 \"strong vs weak model\" 的分组叙事——所有模型的 transition 形态 \n      qualitatively 一致（gradual）。cross_model_std=2.23pp 说明模型间存在 \n      absolute level 差异但 transition 形态 homogeneous。tail-384 四模型均远高于 \n      head-2048 (~79%, Δ≈6-9pp)，information locality 发现 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Curve with tail-384 新数据点\"\n        columns: [Model, tail-256, tail-384, tail-512, tail-1024, tail-2048,\n                  \"Δ(256→384)\", \"Δ(384→512)\", sharpness_index]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, \"77.5%\", \"85.6%\", \"93.6%\", \"96.5%\", \"97.3%\",\n             \"+8.1pp\", \"+8.0pp\", 0.52]\n          - [DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, \"76.4%\", \"84.3%\", \"93.9%\", \"96.5%\", \"95.0%\",\n             \"+7.9pp\", \"+9.6pp\", 0.46]\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, \"72.6%\", \"83.2%\", \"95.6%\", \"96.6%\", \"97.9%\",\n             \"+10.6pp\", \"+12.4pp\", 0.44]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B-Instruct, \"77.9%\", \"88.3%\", \"97.5%\", \"98.2%\", \"collapsed\",\n             \"+10.4pp\", \"+9.2pp\", 0.54]\n      - name: \"Sharpness index 汇总\"\n        columns: [Metric, Value, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Mean sharpness, 0.49, \"几乎完美 midpoint → gradual transition\"]\n          - [Range, \"[0.44, 0.54]\", \"所有模型 within [0.35, 0.65] → 无 outlier\"]\n          - [Cross-model std, \"2.23pp\", \"moderate variation, within [2.0, 5.0]\"]\n          - [All > head-2048, \"Yes (Δ 4-9pp)\", \"information locality confirmed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Budget curve (overlay): x=tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048],\n        y=accuracy (%)。4 条曲线 log-shaped，tail-384 点落在 256-512 连线的 \n        中间位置（无 elbow），视觉上确认 smooth gradient。水平虚线标注 \n        exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。灰色 band 标注 head-2048 range \n        (75-81%) 作为对照，突出 tail >> head 约 15pp。\n      - >\n        Δ bar chart: 每个模型两个 bar（Δ256→384 vs Δ384→512），四组并排。\n        所有模型两个 Δ 相近（ratio 0.8-1.1），视觉确认 gradual（若 sharp \n        则两个 bar 高度会差 >3x）。\n    analysis: >\n      tail-384 数据明确排除 sharp phase transition 假说。四模型 sharpness \n      index 集中在 0.44-0.54（mean=0.49），指向 transition 恰好在 midpoint \n      附近——信息是随 token budget 线性累积的，不存在 critical threshold。\n      关键影响：(1) Claim 2 措辞从 \"phase transition\" 改为 \"diminishing \n      returns with steepest gains in 256-512 range\"；(2) budget curve 的 \n      核心价值是展示 tail >> head（information locality），不是定位拐点；\n      (3) 四模型形态一致（all gradual）简化了叙事——不需要 model-dependent \n      transition 的 caveat，可以统一说 \"all models show consistent \n      log-shaped diminishing returns\"。这比 mixed sharp/gradual 结果 \n      更有利于论文叙事清晰度。budget curve 降为 supporting figure \n      （1/3 page），label_only 26/74 分解保持 Claim 2 核心地位。\n\n  - name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n    plan_id: plan_017\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b: {seed42: 0.936, seed123: 0.919, seed456: 0.947, mean: 0.934, std_pp: 1.41}\n      deepseek: {seed42: 0.939, seed123: 0.892, seed456: 0.935, mean: 0.922, std_pp: 2.63}\n      qwen15b: {seed42: 0.956, seed123: 0.932, seed456: 0.949, mean: 0.946, std_pp: 1.24}\n      codellama13b: {seed42: 0.975, seed123: 0.958, seed456: 0.971, mean: 0.968, std_pp: 0.89}\n      cross_model_avg_std_pp: 1.54\n      worst_seed_still_above_head2048: true\n      rank_ordering_preserved_all_seeds: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档定义 cross-seed variance σ 1-3pp at tail-512，noise 不否定趋势但\n      削弱 point estimate 精度。tail-512 位于 budget curve 的 steep gain 段终点，\n      LoRA 初始化对此 regime 的影响比 plateau 段（1024/2048）更大。DeepSeek 方差 \n      最高（σ≈2.6pp），与已知 LoRA sensitivity 一致——exception_only 上 DeepSeek \n      σ=4.8pp（seed123 outlier 91.09%），tail-512 输入更复杂（包含非 exception 的 \n      Tier 2 noise tokens），seed123 的 LoRA 初始化弱点在噪声更多的 input 下被放大。\n      但 DeepSeek seed123 的 89.2% 仍远高于 head-2048（~79%），information locality \n      结论不受影响。Qwen-7B σ=1.4pp，高于 exception_only 的 0pp，因为 tail-512 \n      包含更多需要学习的 non-trivial mapping（loop fragments 等），training \n      stochasticity 有更大 impact。CodeLlama-13B σ 最小（0.9pp），13B 参数量 \n      提供最平滑的 LoRA landscape。Qwen-1.5B σ=1.2pp，比预期低——可能因 1.5B \n      模型的 LoRA 虽然 rugged 但 capacity 限制使得所有 seed 都收敛到 similar \n      capacity-bounded solution。关键：rank ordering（CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B > \n      Qwen-7B > DeepSeek）在所有 3 seeds 上保持一致，trend robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\"\n        columns: [Model, Seed42, Seed123, Seed456, Mean, Std, \"Min-Max Band\",\n                  \"Min > head-2048?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"93.6%\", \"91.9%\", \"94.7%\", \"93.4%\", \"1.4pp\", \"2.8pp\", \"Yes (91.9>81.0)\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, \"93.9%\", \"89.2%\", \"93.5%\", \"92.2%\", \"2.6pp\", \"4.7pp\", \"Yes (89.2>79.2)\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"95.6%\", \"93.2%\", \"94.9%\", \"94.6%\", \"1.2pp\", \"2.4pp\", \"Yes (93.2>75.3)\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"97.5%\", \"95.8%\", \"97.1%\", \"96.8%\", \"0.9pp\", \"1.7pp\", \"Yes (95.8>79.9)\"]\n      - name: \"Convergence band vs model capability\"\n        columns: [Group, Models, Avg_Std, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Lower variance\", \"Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B\", \"1.1pp\",\n             \"Capacity extremes (very small/very large) → deterministic convergence\"]\n          - [\"Higher variance\", \"Qwen-7B, DeepSeek-6.7B\", \"2.0pp\",\n             \"Mid-scale models with more complex LoRA landscapes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Budget curve with error bands: 4 models × 5 budget points (256-2048)，\n        tail-512 处添加 3-seed error bar (mean ± 1σ)。即使最宽 error bar \n        (DeepSeek ±2.6pp)，tail-512 下界 (89.2%) 仍远高于 head-2048 上界 \n        (~81%)，visual confirmation of information locality robustness。\n    analysis: >\n      cross-seed 数据确认：(1) tail >> head 趋势在所有 seeds 上稳健——\n      worst-case tail-512 (DeepSeek seed123=89.2%) 仍比 best-case head-2048 \n      (~81%) 高 8pp；(2) point estimate 精度有限，单 seed 结果应附 ±2pp \n      uncertainty；(3) rank ordering 完全 preserved（所有 3 seeds 上 \n      CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B > Qwen-7B ≈ DeepSeek），model capability \n      对 absolute level 的影响 consistent。对论文的操作建议：budget curve \n      figure 中为 tail-512 标注 3-seed error bar，caption 注明 \"typical \n      σ ≈ 1-3pp across models\"。不需要报告 all 12 individual numbers \n      in main text——mean ± std 足够。审稿人问 \"single seed?\" 时可指向 \n      appendix full table。24 GPU-hours 投入较大，但回应审稿人的 \n      single-seed concern 是高优先级需求，值得。\n\n  - name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n    plan_id: plan_018\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析各条件 failure modes 差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_errors: 2\n      exception_only_categories: {GeneratorExit_irreducible: 2}\n      exception_only_direction: \"100% pass→fail FN\"\n      vota_errors: 7\n      vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n      vota_unique_errors: 5\n      vota_dominant_pattern: \"Tier 2 noise: loop artifact (3) + attention dilution (2)\"\n      full_trace_errors: 217\n      full_trace_overlap_with_no_trace_pct: 0.63\n      full_trace_unique_errors_pct: 0.37\n      full_trace_length_error_correlation_r: 0.41\n      full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.33\n      full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.09\n      no_trace_errors: 296\n      no_trace_dominant_pattern: \"majority class bias + code complexity correlation\"\n      loop_only_errors: 171\n      tier1_tier2_error_jaccard: 0.01\n      cross_model_irreducible_overlap_jaccard: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error analysis 在 median 档下揭示条件间 qualitatively different failure modes，\n      为现有 claims 提供 supporting evidence 但不产生新发现。推理链：\n\n      (1) exception_only 的 2 个 error (id=901, 905) 已被完全解释——GeneratorExit 是 \n      Python all() 短路的 BaseException，tracer 统一标 [ERROR]。模型看到 7 行 \n      [ERROR] GeneratorExit 合理预测 fail。这是 representation-inherent error，\n      非模型不足。跨 Qwen 3 seeds 完全重合确认是 data property。\n\n      (2) VOTA 额外 5 个 error 源自 Tier 2 noise：3 例中 loop compression 产生 \n      正常行为摘要但同时存在 exception（矛盾信号让模型犹豫，confidence 下降）；\n      2 例中 Tier 2 tokens 稀释了对 exception 的 attention（输入更长，exception \n      信号占比更低）。这直接 quantify \"combining tiers introduces noise\" (Claim 3)。\n\n      (3) full_trace 的 217 个 error 中 ~63% 也是 no_trace 的错误——这些是 \n      intrinsically hard cases，trace 未提供 accessible 的额外信号（signal \n      buried in thousands of tokens）。剩余 37% 是 full_trace unique errors——\n      trace 信息 actively misleading（长 trace 中的 intermediate exception \n      被 caught 但 trace 仍包含 [ERROR]，模型误判）或 attention 被长 context \n      分散。error rate 与 trace length 正相关 (r≈0.41)：>1500 tokens 的 trace \n      error rate ~33% vs <500 tokens ~9%，information overload 的 dose-response。\n\n      (4) Tier 1 和 Tier 2 的 error sets 几乎不重叠 (Jaccard=0.01)：Tier 1 \n      fails 在 representation ambiguity (GeneratorExit)，Tier 2 fails 在 \n      reasoning complexity (loop behavior interpretation)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error mode distribution by condition (Qwen-7B seed42)\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"Total Errors\", \"Error Rate\", \"fail→pass (%)\", \n                  \"pass→fail (%)\", \"Dominant Failure Mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2, \"0.17%\", \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"]\n          - [ae_only, 1, \"0.08%\", \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit variant\"]\n          - [VOTA, 7, \"0.59%\", \"57%\", \"43%\", \"Tier 2 noise conflict\"]\n          - [loop_only, 171, \"14.4%\", \"36%\", \"64%\", \"Insufficient diagnostic signal\"]\n          - [full_trace, 217, \"18.2%\", \"47%\", \"53%\", \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"]\n          - [label_only, 164, \"13.8%\", \"65%\", \"35%\", \"Gradient dilution residual\"]\n          - [no_trace, 296, \"24.9%\", \"70%\", \"30%\", \"Majority class bias\"]\n      - name: \"Error rate by trace length bucket (full_trace)\"\n        columns: [Length_Bucket, N_Samples, Errors, Error_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<500 tok\", \"~190\", \"~17\", \"~9%\"]\n          - [\"500-1000 tok\", \"~340\", \"~54\", \"~16%\"]\n          - [\"1000-1500 tok\", \"~370\", \"~72\", \"~19%\"]\n          - [\">1500 tok\", \"~290\", \"~96\", \"~33%\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-condition error overlap (Jaccard, Qwen-7B)\"\n        columns: [Pair, Jaccard, Shared_Errors, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only ∩ VOTA\", 0.29, 2, \"VOTA superset includes Tier 1 irreducible\"]\n          - [\"full_trace ∩ no_trace\", 0.36, 137, \"63% of full_trace errors also in no_trace\"]\n          - [\"loop_only ∩ label_only\", 0.40, 95, \"Similar difficulty: trace-as-context conditions\"]\n          - [\"Tier 1 ∩ Tier 2 errors\", 0.01, 0, \"Qualitatively different failure modes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace): x=input token count, \n        y=binary correct/incorrect, with binned trend line. Shows dose-response \n        of information overload. Pearson r≈0.41 annotated.\n      - >\n        Venn diagram: exception_only (2 errors) vs VOTA (7 errors). \n        Overlap = 2 (GeneratorExit). 5 unique VOTA errors labeled by \n        root cause category. Visually demonstrates Tier 2 noise.\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 为 3 个 Claims 提供 converging evidence：(1) exception_only \n      的 irreducible 2/1190 errors 跨模型重叠（Jaccard 0.85）确认是 data/\n      representation property（Claim 1 \"ceiling\" 论点）；(2) full_trace \n      error-length correlation r=0.41 是 information overload 的 direct \n      evidence（Claim 2）；(3) VOTA 的 5 个 Tier 2-attributable errors \n      quantify \"noise from combining tiers\"（Claim 3）。在 median 档下 \n      这些发现 expected 但 useful——审稿人会 appreciate 对 error 的 \n      systematic analysis，但不会视为 independent contribution。建议作为 \n      Appendix B（~1 page: 1 table + 2 case studies + correlation plot），\n      main text 中引用关键数字（\"full_trace error rate correlates with \n      trace length, r=0.41, confirming information overload hypothesis\"）。\n      0 GPU-hours，纯分析，ROI 极高。\n\n  - name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n    plan_id: plan_019\n    description: \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.0027, brier: 0.0013, mce: 0.835}\n      deepseek_seed42: {accuracy: 0.9933, ece: 0.012, brier: 0.006, mce: 0.45}\n      qwen15b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.005, brier: 0.003, mce: 0.62}\n      codellama13b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.003, brier: 0.002, mce: 0.75}\n      all_nonoutlier_ece_below: 0.015\n      ece_range: [0.0027, 0.012]\n      ece_ratio_vs_notrace_range: [14, 63]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration 直接跟随 accuracy 和 error 数量。三个 99.83% 模型（Qwen-7B, \n      Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B）仅有 2 个相同 error（GeneratorExit），calibration \n      差异仅来自 confidence distribution 的模型间差异：\n\n      Qwen-7B (ECE=0.0027, 已有数据): 基准。2 个 misclassified samples 的 \n      confidence 贡献几乎全部 ECE。\n\n      CodeLlama-13B (ECE≈0.003): 13B 参数量产生更 peaked softmax distribution，\n      correct predictions 的 confidence 更接近 1.0。2 个 error 的 confidence \n      也偏高（模型更 \"确定\"），但 overall 因 correct predictions 的 near-perfect \n      calibration 而 ECE 极低。略高于 Qwen-7B 因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template \n      与训练数据的 alignment 略有差异。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B (ECE≈0.005): 同 Qwen tokenizer，same 2 errors。但 1.5B 模型的 \n      softmax entropy 更高（small model less confident），correct predictions \n      的 mean confidence 可能在 ~0.95 而非 ~0.99，造成 systematic slight \n      under-confidence → ECE 略高。\n\n      DeepSeek seed42 (ECE≈0.012): 8 个 errors（vs others 的 2 个），4× 更多 \n      misclassified bins 贡献 ECE。其中部分 fail samples 被高 confidence 预测为 \n      pass（LoRA 训练不完全映射 exception→fail），这些 high-confidence wrong \n      predictions 是 ECE 的主要 contributor。但 0.012 仍远低于 no_trace 的 0.171 \n      （14× improvement）。\n\n      总体：所有模型 ECE < 0.015，exception signal 的 calibration 优势跨模型 \n      robust。magnitude 差异主要由 error count 驱动，非 signal quality 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model calibration for exception_only\"\n        columns: [Model, Accuracy, ECE, Brier, \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, \"99.83%\", 0.0027, 0.0013, \"63×\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B-Instruct, \"99.83%\", 0.003, 0.002, \"57×\"]\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, \"99.83%\", 0.005, 0.003, \"34×\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, \"99.33%\", 0.012, 0.006, \"14×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Reliability diagram (2×2 grid): 每模型一 panel，predicted probability \n        vs observed frequency。三个 99.83% 模型的 curves 紧贴 diagonal，\n        DeepSeek 的 curve 在 0.8-0.95 bin 略偏（overconfident on some \n        misclassified samples）。\n      - >\n        ECE comparison bar chart: 4 models × exception_only，with Qwen-7B \n        的 no_trace/full_trace/VOTA ECE 作参考线。所有 exception_only bars \n        极短（≤0.012），no_trace reference line (0.171) 显著高。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 证实 exception signal 的 calibration 优势 \n      不限于 Qwen-7B——所有 4 模型 ECE ≤ 0.012，与 no_trace ECE 0.171 \n      相比 14-63× improvement。论文可 claim \"exception_only achieves \n      near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.012) across all tested models, \n      regardless of architecture and scale\"。这是独立于 accuracy 的 \n      evidence dimension：即使审稿人质疑 99.83% 是 saturation，ECE/Brier \n      数据证明模型 \"knows what it knows\"——confidence 与 correctness \n      高度一致。DeepSeek 的略高 ECE (0.012) 与其更多 errors (8 vs 2) \n      一致，不 undermine overall finding。建议作为 main text Table \n      （与 accuracy table 并列或合并为一张大表），1 GPU-hour \n      investment，cost-effective。\n\n  - name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception: 0.952\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_ci: [0.937, 0.965]\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception: 0.966\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_ci: [0.953, 0.977]\n      claude_0shot_exception: 0.958\n      claude_0shot_exception_ci: [0.944, 0.971]\n      claude_3shot_exception: 0.972\n      claude_3shot_exception_ci: [0.959, 0.982]\n      gpt4o_0shot_no_trace: 0.805\n      claude_0shot_no_trace: 0.821\n      sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_advantage_vs_best_frontier_pp: 2.6\n      sft_qwen15b_advantage_vs_gpt4o_pp: 2.6\n      api_cost_total_usd: 18\n      sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frontier models 的 exception_only 0-shot 能达 95-96% 因为 task 在 \n      exception_only 格式下高度 interpretable：有 [ERROR] → fail，无 [ERROR] → \n      pass。已有 local model zero-shot 数据（Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, DeepSeek 90.59%）\n      证明不需要 SFT 就能达到 ~90%+。Frontier models 更强的 instruction following \n      + 更广的 code knowledge 在此基础上再提升 ~3-5pp：\n\n      (1) GPT-4o 0-shot 95.2%：比 local Qwen-1.5B zero-shot (93.45%) 仅高 1.8pp\n      ——exception task 对 model scale 的 marginal return 很低（进一步证明是 \n      signal-limited not capacity-limited）。剩余 4.8% error 来自：GeneratorExit \n      等 non-fatal exceptions（同 SFT 模型）、format marker 的不一致解读、\n      边缘 case 的 conservative \"fail\" 偏好。\n\n      (2) 3-shot 额外 +1.4-1.4pp：exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision \n      boundary，特别是处理 [No exception data in trace] marker 的一致性。\n      但 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖 exception type 的 long-tail distribution。\n\n      (3) SFT Qwen-7B (99.83%) 仍高于 best frontier 3-shot (Claude 97.2%) \n      2.6pp。虽然 pp gap 不大，但 error count 差异显著：2 vs ~33 errors，\n      16.5× fewer mistakes。且 SFT inference cost 是 frontier API 的 ~1/1800。\n\n      (4) Frontier no_trace (80-82%) >> SFT no_trace (75.1%)：frontier model \n      的 code reasoning 能力可部分替代 trace 信息，但仍远低于 SFT + \n      exception_only (99.83%)——exception signal + SFT 的组合效果不可被 \n      单纯 model scale 替代。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs frontier few-shot comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Model, Input, Shots, Accuracy, \"Errors/1190\",\n                  \"Approx Cost\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT, Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.01\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.005\"]\n          - [SFT, CodeLlama-13B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.02\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, 3, \"96.6%\", \"~40\", \"$8\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, exception_only, 3, \"97.2%\", \"~33\", \"$10\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, 0, \"95.2%\", \"~57\", \"$5\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, exception_only, 0, \"95.8%\", \"~50\", \"$7\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, no_trace, 0, \"80.5%\", \"~232\", \"$3\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, no_trace, 0, \"82.1%\", \"~213\", \"$5\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-7B, no_trace, \"—\", \"75.1%\", 296, \"$0.01\"]\n      - name: \"Error count perspective (补充审稿人 'gap only 2-3pp' 的 concern)\"\n        columns: [Model, Accuracy, Errors, \"Error Reduction vs frontier best\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SFT Qwen-7B exception_only\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3-shot exception_only\", \"97.2%\", \"~33\", \"16.5× more errors\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only\", \"96.6%\", \"~40\", \"20× more errors\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Accuracy bar chart: SFT models (4 bars at 99.83%) vs frontier \n        few-shot (4 bars at 95-97%) vs frontier no_trace (2 bars at 80-82%).\n        SFT advantage visually clear despite small pp gap — the ceiling \n        region (99%+) makes absolute difference look small but relative \n        error reduction is dramatic.\n      - >\n        Cost-accuracy scatter: x=log10(cost in $), y=accuracy (%). SFT \n        points cluster in top-left (high accuracy, low cost), frontier \n        in bottom-right. Pareto frontier clearly dominated by SFT.\n    analysis: >\n      Frontier baseline 在 median 档下提供 solid but not overwhelming \n      evidence：SFT beats frontier 3-shot by ~2.6pp (error count 16-20× \n      reduction)。这足以 claim \"task-specific SFT on 7B model surpasses \n      frontier few-shot\" 但审稿人可能视 2.6pp 为 modest。Rebuttal 策略：\n      (a) 强调 error count 而非 pp——\"from ~33 errors to 2 irreducible \n      errors\" 更有冲击力；(b) cost perspective——1800× cheaper；(c) \n      offline deployability。最有价值的发现：frontier models 也从 \n      exception traces 大幅获益 (no_trace→exception: +14-15pp)，\n      independent confirm Claim 1/2。建议 main text 用 1 paragraph + \n      1 table 呈现，full results 放 appendix。0 GPU-hours，仅 API \n      cost ~$18。如果 deadline 紧张可 deprioritize——核心 claims \n      不依赖此数据。\n\n  - name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      python_ood_exception_only: 0.963\n      python_ood_degradation_pp: -3.5\n      java_exception_only: 0.918\n      java_degradation_pp: -8.0\n      javascript_exception_only: 0.902\n      javascript_degradation_pp: -9.6\n      cross_lang_mean: 0.928\n      cross_lang_mean_degradation_pp: -7.0\n      python_ood_no_trace: 0.715\n      java_no_trace: 0.680\n      javascript_no_trace: 0.665\n      exception_lift_over_notrace_ood_mean_pp: 24.1\n      ood_test_set_size_per_lang: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 泛化性取决于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。\n      [ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer 的统一输出规范，但 exception \n      type 名称和 error message 惯例跨语言不同，造成 token-level distribution shift。\n\n      Python OOD (-3.5pp, 96.3%): 同语言不同项目，exception type 分布与训练集 \n      高度重叠（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError 是 universal），仅 project-specific \n      custom exception classes 造成少量降级。测试集项目的 test structure（pytest \n      fixtures、多文件 import）可能引入不同的 exception context，但 [ERROR] tag \n      的 binary signal 不受影响。\n\n      Java (-8.0pp, 91.8%): NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 \n      Java-specific type names 训练集未出现——模型无法利用 type-level semantics，\n      退化到依赖 [ERROR] tag presence 的 binary heuristic。但 binary heuristic \n      本身在 Qwen-7B zero-shot 上已达 ~89%，SFT 的 fine-tuned decision boundary \n      在新 type names 上部分失效。\n\n      JavaScript (-9.6pp, 90.2%): 最大降级。JS 的 error handling 更独特（Promise \n      rejection → UnhandledPromiseRejection, async TypeError），且 error message \n      格式与 Python 差异最大。tracer 对 JS 的 [ERROR] 标注可能不如 Python \n      consistent（implementation difference）。\n\n      关键：所有语言上 exception_only lift over no_trace ≈ 24pp（与 in-domain \n      24.7pp 几乎相同），证明 exception signal 的 fault detection mechanism \n      跨语言 transferable。Absolute degradation 来自 token vocabulary shift \n      而非 mechanism failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"In-distribution vs OOD accuracy by language\"\n        columns: [Language, Setting, exception_only, no_trace, \"Lift\",\n                  \"Degradation vs ID\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Python, \"ID (HumanEval+MBPP)\", \"99.83%\", \"75.1%\", \"+24.7pp\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [Python, \"OOD (new projects)\", \"96.3%\", \"71.5%\", \"+24.8pp\", \"-3.5pp\"]\n          - [Java, OOD, \"91.8%\", \"68.0%\", \"+23.8pp\", \"-8.0pp\"]\n          - [JavaScript, OOD, \"90.2%\", \"66.5%\", \"+23.7pp\", \"-9.6pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: 4 language settings × 2 conditions (exception_only \n        vs no_trace)。exception_only lift (~24pp) 在所有 settings 上几乎 \n        constant，即使 absolute accuracy drops。Visual emphasis on preserved \n        lift rather than absolute degradation.\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 实验在 median 档下是最大 risk/reward 投资。如果完成，可 claim \n      \"exception signal advantage transfers across languages with preserved \n      lift (~24pp) despite moderate absolute degradation (7pp mean)\"——\n      部分回应 single-task scope criticism。但 risk factors：(1) 需要 \n      构建 3 个语言的 OOD 数据集（trace 生成 + 人工验证），timeline \n      紧张；(2) tracer 对 Java/JS 的 implementation 可能有 quality \n      issues，影响实验可控性；(3) 如果某语言降到 <85%，审稿人可能 \n      反向 argue \"not robust enough\"。在 ARR May 25 deadline (7天后) \n      前几乎不可能完成——建议 deprioritize，标注为 camera-ready \n      supplement 或 future work。如果有余力，优先做 Python OOD \n      （无需新 tracer，仅需新测试集），~4 GPU-hours 即可。\n\n  - name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve（每 ~50 steps eval）\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_frac_to_90pct: 0.05\n      exception_only_frac_to_95pct: 0.08\n      exception_only_frac_to_99pct: 0.20\n      exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n      vota_frac_to_90pct: 0.10\n      vota_frac_to_95pct: 0.15\n      vota_frac_to_99pct: 0.30\n      vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n      full_trace_frac_to_80pct: 0.30\n      full_trace_peak: {accuracy: 0.830, epoch: 1}\n      full_trace_final: 0.8176\n      full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_epoch2_dip\n      no_trace_plateau_frac: 0.15\n      no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n      no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n      convergence_ratio_exception_vs_vota: 1.9\n      convergence_ratio_exception_vs_fulltrace: 3.8\n      learning_efficiency_exception_samples_per_pp: 9.2\n      learning_efficiency_fulltrace_samples_per_pp: 68.5\n      efficiency_ratio: 7.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的 \n      影响。所有数值表示为 training fraction（0=start, 1.0=end of 3 epochs），\n      因 absolute step count 取决于 batch size 等 hyperparameters。\n\n      exception_only 收敛最快（~5% training 达 90%, ~8% 达 95%）：input 极短 \n      （mean <100 tokens），gradient 完全集中在 verdict signal 上；effective \n      unique 样本仅 2858，但 binary structure（有 exception→fail, 无→pass）\n      极其 learnable。已有 epoch-level 数据佐证：Qwen-7B exception_only 3 \n      seeds 均在 epoch1 结束时已达 99.83%（之后 epochs 无提升）——暗示 \n      实际在 epoch1 早期就已收敛。\n\n      full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：已有 epoch-level 数据 \n      （epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%, epoch3=81.76%）展示 epoch2 坍塌。\n      中间 eval 应能捕获更 fine-grained 的 oscillation pattern。峰值在 \n      ~30% training（epoch1 中后段），之后 overfitting 到 trace patterns \n      而非 verdict signal 导致 epoch2 下降。epoch3 partial recovery 可能 \n      是 random fluctuation。\n\n      VOTA 介于两者之间：含 Tier 1 (fast learning) + Tier 2 (slow learning) \n      信号，combined curve 的前段被 Tier 1 驱动（快速上升到 >95%），后段 \n      Tier 2 贡献边际提升。已有 epoch-level (epoch1=99.33%, epoch2-3=99.41%) \n      确认 epoch1 几乎完成所有学习。\n\n      no_trace 快速 plateau：无 trace signal 可学习，模型在 ~15% training \n      后耗尽 code→verdict 的弱 statistical correlation，之后 flat。\n\n      Learning efficiency ratio: exception_only 每 pp 需 ~9.2 个 effective \n      training samples（2858 unique / (99.83-75.13) pp），full_trace 需 ~68.5 \n      （~5800 / (81.76-75.13) pp），7.4× 差距直接 quantify information \n      density 的 learning advantage。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Convergence milestones (fraction of total training)\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"To 80%\", \"To 90%\", \"To 95%\", \"To 99%\", \n                  \"Final Accuracy\", \"Curve Shape\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, \"~3%\", \"~5%\", \"~8%\", \"~20%\", \"99.83%\", \"Rapid saturation\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5%\", \"~10%\", \"~15%\", \"~30%\", \"99.41%\", \"Moderate saturation\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~30%\", never, never, never, \"81.76%\", \"Non-monotonic (epoch2 dip)\"]\n          - [loop_only, \"~12%\", never, never, never, \"85.63%\", \"Slow saturation\"]\n          - [no_trace, never, never, never, never, \"75.13%\", \"Low-ceiling plateau\"]\n      - name: \"Learning efficiency comparison\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"Effective Unique Samples\", \"Lift (pp)\", \n                  \"Samples per pp\", \"Efficiency (relative)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2858, 24.7, 9.2, \"1.0× (ref)\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5800\", 24.3, 17.5, \"0.53×\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~5800\", 6.6, 72.1, \"0.13×\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"~5800\", 3.6, 132.8, \"0.07×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Learning curve plot (main figure): x=training progress (fraction), \n        y=eval accuracy (%). 4+ curves, eval points every ~2-3% of training.\n        exception_only (red solid) rockets up and saturates by ~10%, \n        VOTA (blue solid) follows ~2× slower. full_trace (green dashed) \n        shows non-monotonic pattern with epoch2 dip. no_trace (gray dotted) \n        flat at ~75%. Horizontal dashed line at 71.5% (majority baseline).\n        Visual impact: exception_only learning curve is dramatically \n        steeper than all others.\n      - >\n        Learning efficiency bar chart: samples-per-pp for each condition.\n        exception_only (9.2) vs full_trace (72.1) = 7.4× gap. Direct \n        visualization of information density effect on learning.\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 提供 process-level evidence（补充已有 \n      outcome-level evidence）。核心 finding：exception_only 不仅 final \n      accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也 7.4× higher——denser signal \n      → faster and better learning。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve \n      （epoch2 dip from 83% to 76%）是 information overload 的 dynamic \n      manifestation：模型先学到 some useful trace patterns (epoch1 peak)，\n      然后 overfits to noise (epoch2 collapse)，部分恢复 (epoch3)。\n      这呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)。\n\n      审稿人可能 challenge: \"faster convergence is trivially expected \n      for shorter sequences\"。Rebuttal: shorter sequences + diagnostic \n      signal concentration 共同作用——loop_only 的 sequence 长度与 \n      full_trace 相当但 efficiency 5× higher (因 loop 信号 denser than \n      raw trace)，证明不只是 length effect。\n\n      建议作为 Figure in main text（visual impact 强）但不升为 \n      standalone claim。需修改 train_sft.py 添加 intermediate eval \n      callback，8 GPU-hours。如果 deadline 紧张，可引用现有 \n      epoch-level 数据（epoch1 vs epoch3）作为 coarse-grained proxy \n      代替 fine-grained learning curve。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21729,"cache_read_input_tokens":83511,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21729},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca021833-68ad-48d2-8c47-9a2b5434c32f","uuid":"103c7e0e-8cce-401a-a7c4-2890a3a7c93b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":811424,"duration_api_ms":812879,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have the full context. Let me verify the tail budget curve anchor data precisely, then generate the predictions.\n\nKey existing tail data for calibration:\n- **Qwen-7B**: tail-256=77.5%, tail-512=93.6%, tail-1024=96.5%, tail-2048=97.3%\n- **DeepSeek**: tail-256=76.4%, tail-512=93.9%, tail-1024=96.5%, tail-2048=95.0%\n- **Qwen-1.5B**: tail-256=72.6%, tail-512=95.6%, tail-1024=96.6%, tail-2048=97.9%\n- **CodeLlama-13B**: tail-256=77.9%, tail-512=97.5%, tail-1024=98.2%, tail-2048=collapsed\n\nNote: the prior dream report (dream_20260518T113804) incorrectly split models into \"sharp vs gradual\" groups, contradicting the median tier definition which specifies \"tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%, transition 是 smooth gradient 非 sharp boundary\". I'll correct this.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 从 'phase transition in trace informativeness' 改为 'diagnostic signal concentrates\n  in trace tail with diminishing returns; information density — not gradient dilution —\n  is the primary bottleneck'。tail-384 在四模型上均落在 256→512 的 43-53% 位置（83-88%），\n  确认 smooth gradient 而非 sharp boundary。Budget curve 四模型趋势一致（log-shaped \n  diminishing returns），但无共同拐点——每个模型的 steepest gain 区间长度和位置略有不同。\n  Budget curve 从 standalone finding 降为 supporting figure，label_only 26/74 分解升为 \n  Claim 2 sole quantitative evidence。补偿措施: (a) tail-512≫head-2048（~94% vs ~79%, \n  Δ≈15pp）作为 information locality 的 strong evidence；(b) exception_only scale invariance\n  （1.5B=7B=13B=99.83%）提升至更高叙事位置；(c) cross-model calibration (plan_019, 1h) + \n  error analysis (plan_018, 0h) 增加独立 evidence 维度。cross-seed σ~1-3pp 不否定趋势但\n  削弱 point estimate 精度，所有 budget curve 数字需附 uncertainty band。仍冲 Main，\n  Findings 作 fallback。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 models，精确定位 256→512 区间 transition 形态\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.856\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.835, 0.877]\n      qwen7b_sharpness_index: 0.52\n      deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.843\n      deepseek_tail384_ci: [0.821, 0.865]\n      deepseek_sharpness_index: 0.46\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.832\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.808, 0.854]\n      qwen15b_sharpness_index: 0.44\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.883\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.863, 0.903]\n      codellama13b_sharpness_index: 0.54\n      four_model_mean: 0.854\n      four_model_std_pp: 2.23\n      mean_sharpness_index: 0.49\n      all_models_gradual: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档定义 tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%，transition 为 smooth gradient。\n      推导逻辑：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾（crash point + stack trace），\n      tail-256 捕获 assertion 结果和 traceback 尾部但常截断中段 context；tail-384 \n      额外覆盖约 128 tokens 的 traceback context（调用栈前几帧、变量快照），提供 \n      incremental 而非 step-function 式的信息增益。四模型 sharpness index 均在 \n      0.44-0.54 范围（center 0.49，几乎正好 midpoint），没有模型出现 <0.3（sharp \n      stay at 256 level）或 >0.7（sharp jump to 512 level）。CodeLlama-13B 略高 \n      （0.54）因 13B 参数量更有效利用 partial exception context；Qwen-1.5B 略低 \n      （0.44）因小模型从 partial signal 中提取信息的效率较低。但差异幅度仅 0.10，\n      不足以形成 \"strong vs weak model\" 的分组叙事——所有模型的 transition 形态 \n      qualitatively 一致（gradual）。cross_model_std=2.23pp 说明模型间存在 \n      absolute level 差异但 transition 形态 homogeneous。tail-384 四模型均远高于 \n      head-2048 (~79%, Δ≈6-9pp)，information locality 发现 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Budget Curve with tail-384 新数据点\"\n        columns: [Model, tail-256, tail-384, tail-512, tail-1024, tail-2048,\n                  \"Δ(256→384)\", \"Δ(384→512)\", sharpness_index]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, \"77.5%\", \"85.6%\", \"93.6%\", \"96.5%\", \"97.3%\",\n             \"+8.1pp\", \"+8.0pp\", 0.52]\n          - [DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, \"76.4%\", \"84.3%\", \"93.9%\", \"96.5%\", \"95.0%\",\n             \"+7.9pp\", \"+9.6pp\", 0.46]\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, \"72.6%\", \"83.2%\", \"95.6%\", \"96.6%\", \"97.9%\",\n             \"+10.6pp\", \"+12.4pp\", 0.44]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B-Instruct, \"77.9%\", \"88.3%\", \"97.5%\", \"98.2%\", \"collapsed\",\n             \"+10.4pp\", \"+9.2pp\", 0.54]\n      - name: \"Sharpness index 汇总\"\n        columns: [Metric, Value, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Mean sharpness, 0.49, \"几乎完美 midpoint → gradual transition\"]\n          - [Range, \"[0.44, 0.54]\", \"所有模型 within [0.35, 0.65] → 无 outlier\"]\n          - [Cross-model std, \"2.23pp\", \"moderate variation, within [2.0, 5.0]\"]\n          - [All > head-2048, \"Yes (Δ 4-9pp)\", \"information locality confirmed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Budget curve (overlay): x=tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048],\n        y=accuracy (%)。4 条曲线 log-shaped，tail-384 点落在 256-512 连线的 \n        中间位置（无 elbow），视觉上确认 smooth gradient。水平虚线标注 \n        exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。灰色 band 标注 head-2048 range \n        (75-81%) 作为对照，突出 tail >> head 约 15pp。\n      - >\n        Δ bar chart: 每个模型两个 bar（Δ256→384 vs Δ384→512），四组并排。\n        所有模型两个 Δ 相近（ratio 0.8-1.1），视觉确认 gradual（若 sharp \n        则两个 bar 高度会差 >3x）。\n    analysis: >\n      tail-384 数据明确排除 sharp phase transition 假说。四模型 sharpness \n      index 集中在 0.44-0.54（mean=0.49），指向 transition 恰好在 midpoint \n      附近——信息是随 token budget 线性累积的，不存在 critical threshold。\n      关键影响：(1) Claim 2 措辞从 \"phase transition\" 改为 \"diminishing \n      returns with steepest gains in 256-512 range\"；(2) budget curve 的 \n      核心价值是展示 tail >> head（information locality），不是定位拐点；\n      (3) 四模型形态一致（all gradual）简化了叙事——不需要 model-dependent \n      transition 的 caveat，可以统一说 \"all models show consistent \n      log-shaped diminishing returns\"。这比 mixed sharp/gradual 结果 \n      更有利于论文叙事清晰度。budget curve 降为 supporting figure \n      （1/3 page），label_only 26/74 分解保持 Claim 2 核心地位。\n\n  - name: cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\n    plan_id: plan_017\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b: {seed42: 0.936, seed123: 0.919, seed456: 0.947, mean: 0.934, std_pp: 1.41}\n      deepseek: {seed42: 0.939, seed123: 0.892, seed456: 0.935, mean: 0.922, std_pp: 2.63}\n      qwen15b: {seed42: 0.956, seed123: 0.932, seed456: 0.949, mean: 0.946, std_pp: 1.24}\n      codellama13b: {seed42: 0.975, seed123: 0.958, seed456: 0.971, mean: 0.968, std_pp: 0.89}\n      cross_model_avg_std_pp: 1.54\n      worst_seed_still_above_head2048: true\n      rank_ordering_preserved_all_seeds: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档定义 cross-seed variance σ 1-3pp at tail-512，noise 不否定趋势但\n      削弱 point estimate 精度。tail-512 位于 budget curve 的 steep gain 段终点，\n      LoRA 初始化对此 regime 的影响比 plateau 段（1024/2048）更大。DeepSeek 方差 \n      最高（σ≈2.6pp），与已知 LoRA sensitivity 一致——exception_only 上 DeepSeek \n      σ=4.8pp（seed123 outlier 91.09%），tail-512 输入更复杂（包含非 exception 的 \n      Tier 2 noise tokens），seed123 的 LoRA 初始化弱点在噪声更多的 input 下被放大。\n      但 DeepSeek seed123 的 89.2% 仍远高于 head-2048（~79%），information locality \n      结论不受影响。Qwen-7B σ=1.4pp，高于 exception_only 的 0pp，因为 tail-512 \n      包含更多需要学习的 non-trivial mapping（loop fragments 等），training \n      stochasticity 有更大 impact。CodeLlama-13B σ 最小（0.9pp），13B 参数量 \n      提供最平滑的 LoRA landscape。Qwen-1.5B σ=1.2pp，比预期低——可能因 1.5B \n      模型的 LoRA 虽然 rugged 但 capacity 限制使得所有 seed 都收敛到 similar \n      capacity-bounded solution。关键：rank ordering（CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B > \n      Qwen-7B > DeepSeek）在所有 3 seeds 上保持一致，trend robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\"\n        columns: [Model, Seed42, Seed123, Seed456, Mean, Std, \"Min-Max Band\",\n                  \"Min > head-2048?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"93.6%\", \"91.9%\", \"94.7%\", \"93.4%\", \"1.4pp\", \"2.8pp\", \"Yes (91.9>81.0)\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, \"93.9%\", \"89.2%\", \"93.5%\", \"92.2%\", \"2.6pp\", \"4.7pp\", \"Yes (89.2>79.2)\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"95.6%\", \"93.2%\", \"94.9%\", \"94.6%\", \"1.2pp\", \"2.4pp\", \"Yes (93.2>75.3)\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"97.5%\", \"95.8%\", \"97.1%\", \"96.8%\", \"0.9pp\", \"1.7pp\", \"Yes (95.8>79.9)\"]\n      - name: \"Convergence band vs model capability\"\n        columns: [Group, Models, Avg_Std, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Lower variance\", \"Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B\", \"1.1pp\",\n             \"Capacity extremes (very small/very large) → deterministic convergence\"]\n          - [\"Higher variance\", \"Qwen-7B, DeepSeek-6.7B\", \"2.0pp\",\n             \"Mid-scale models with more complex LoRA landscapes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Budget curve with error bands: 4 models × 5 budget points (256-2048)，\n        tail-512 处添加 3-seed error bar (mean ± 1σ)。即使最宽 error bar \n        (DeepSeek ±2.6pp)，tail-512 下界 (89.2%) 仍远高于 head-2048 上界 \n        (~81%)，visual confirmation of information locality robustness。\n    analysis: >\n      cross-seed 数据确认：(1) tail >> head 趋势在所有 seeds 上稳健——\n      worst-case tail-512 (DeepSeek seed123=89.2%) 仍比 best-case head-2048 \n      (~81%) 高 8pp；(2) point estimate 精度有限，单 seed 结果应附 ±2pp \n      uncertainty；(3) rank ordering 完全 preserved（所有 3 seeds 上 \n      CodeLlama > Qwen-1.5B > Qwen-7B ≈ DeepSeek），model capability \n      对 absolute level 的影响 consistent。对论文的操作建议：budget curve \n      figure 中为 tail-512 标注 3-seed error bar，caption 注明 \"typical \n      σ ≈ 1-3pp across models\"。不需要报告 all 12 individual numbers \n      in main text——mean ± std 足够。审稿人问 \"single seed?\" 时可指向 \n      appendix full table。24 GPU-hours 投入较大，但回应审稿人的 \n      single-seed concern 是高优先级需求，值得。\n\n  - name: error_analysis_failure_modes\n    plan_id: plan_018\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析各条件 failure modes 差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_errors: 2\n      exception_only_categories: {GeneratorExit_irreducible: 2}\n      exception_only_direction: \"100% pass→fail FN\"\n      vota_errors: 7\n      vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n      vota_unique_errors: 5\n      vota_dominant_pattern: \"Tier 2 noise: loop artifact (3) + attention dilution (2)\"\n      full_trace_errors: 217\n      full_trace_overlap_with_no_trace_pct: 0.63\n      full_trace_unique_errors_pct: 0.37\n      full_trace_length_error_correlation_r: 0.41\n      full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.33\n      full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.09\n      no_trace_errors: 296\n      no_trace_dominant_pattern: \"majority class bias + code complexity correlation\"\n      loop_only_errors: 171\n      tier1_tier2_error_jaccard: 0.01\n      cross_model_irreducible_overlap_jaccard: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error analysis 在 median 档下揭示条件间 qualitatively different failure modes，\n      为现有 claims 提供 supporting evidence 但不产生新发现。推理链：\n\n      (1) exception_only 的 2 个 error (id=901, 905) 已被完全解释——GeneratorExit 是 \n      Python all() 短路的 BaseException，tracer 统一标 [ERROR]。模型看到 7 行 \n      [ERROR] GeneratorExit 合理预测 fail。这是 representation-inherent error，\n      非模型不足。跨 Qwen 3 seeds 完全重合确认是 data property。\n\n      (2) VOTA 额外 5 个 error 源自 Tier 2 noise：3 例中 loop compression 产生 \n      正常行为摘要但同时存在 exception（矛盾信号让模型犹豫，confidence 下降）；\n      2 例中 Tier 2 tokens 稀释了对 exception 的 attention（输入更长，exception \n      信号占比更低）。这直接 quantify \"combining tiers introduces noise\" (Claim 3)。\n\n      (3) full_trace 的 217 个 error 中 ~63% 也是 no_trace 的错误——这些是 \n      intrinsically hard cases，trace 未提供 accessible 的额外信号（signal \n      buried in thousands of tokens）。剩余 37% 是 full_trace unique errors——\n      trace 信息 actively misleading（长 trace 中的 intermediate exception \n      被 caught 但 trace 仍包含 [ERROR]，模型误判）或 attention 被长 context \n      分散。error rate 与 trace length 正相关 (r≈0.41)：>1500 tokens 的 trace \n      error rate ~33% vs <500 tokens ~9%，information overload 的 dose-response。\n\n      (4) Tier 1 和 Tier 2 的 error sets 几乎不重叠 (Jaccard=0.01)：Tier 1 \n      fails 在 representation ambiguity (GeneratorExit)，Tier 2 fails 在 \n      reasoning complexity (loop behavior interpretation)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error mode distribution by condition (Qwen-7B seed42)\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"Total Errors\", \"Error Rate\", \"fail→pass (%)\", \n                  \"pass→fail (%)\", \"Dominant Failure Mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2, \"0.17%\", \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"]\n          - [ae_only, 1, \"0.08%\", \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit variant\"]\n          - [VOTA, 7, \"0.59%\", \"57%\", \"43%\", \"Tier 2 noise conflict\"]\n          - [loop_only, 171, \"14.4%\", \"36%\", \"64%\", \"Insufficient diagnostic signal\"]\n          - [full_trace, 217, \"18.2%\", \"47%\", \"53%\", \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"]\n          - [label_only, 164, \"13.8%\", \"65%\", \"35%\", \"Gradient dilution residual\"]\n          - [no_trace, 296, \"24.9%\", \"70%\", \"30%\", \"Majority class bias\"]\n      - name: \"Error rate by trace length bucket (full_trace)\"\n        columns: [Length_Bucket, N_Samples, Errors, Error_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<500 tok\", \"~190\", \"~17\", \"~9%\"]\n          - [\"500-1000 tok\", \"~340\", \"~54\", \"~16%\"]\n          - [\"1000-1500 tok\", \"~370\", \"~72\", \"~19%\"]\n          - [\">1500 tok\", \"~290\", \"~96\", \"~33%\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-condition error overlap (Jaccard, Qwen-7B)\"\n        columns: [Pair, Jaccard, Shared_Errors, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only ∩ VOTA\", 0.29, 2, \"VOTA superset includes Tier 1 irreducible\"]\n          - [\"full_trace ∩ no_trace\", 0.36, 137, \"63% of full_trace errors also in no_trace\"]\n          - [\"loop_only ∩ label_only\", 0.40, 95, \"Similar difficulty: trace-as-context conditions\"]\n          - [\"Tier 1 ∩ Tier 2 errors\", 0.01, 0, \"Qualitatively different failure modes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace): x=input token count, \n        y=binary correct/incorrect, with binned trend line. Shows dose-response \n        of information overload. Pearson r≈0.41 annotated.\n      - >\n        Venn diagram: exception_only (2 errors) vs VOTA (7 errors). \n        Overlap = 2 (GeneratorExit). 5 unique VOTA errors labeled by \n        root cause category. Visually demonstrates Tier 2 noise.\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 为 3 个 Claims 提供 converging evidence：(1) exception_only \n      的 irreducible 2/1190 errors 跨模型重叠（Jaccard 0.85）确认是 data/\n      representation property（Claim 1 \"ceiling\" 论点）；(2) full_trace \n      error-length correlation r=0.41 是 information overload 的 direct \n      evidence（Claim 2）；(3) VOTA 的 5 个 Tier 2-attributable errors \n      quantify \"noise from combining tiers\"（Claim 3）。在 median 档下 \n      这些发现 expected 但 useful——审稿人会 appreciate 对 error 的 \n      systematic analysis，但不会视为 independent contribution。建议作为 \n      Appendix B（~1 page: 1 table + 2 case studies + correlation plot），\n      main text 中引用关键数字（\"full_trace error rate correlates with \n      trace length, r=0.41, confirming information overload hypothesis\"）。\n      0 GPU-hours，纯分析，ROI 极高。\n\n  - name: cross_model_calibration_exception_only\n    plan_id: plan_019\n    description: \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.0027, brier: 0.0013, mce: 0.835}\n      deepseek_seed42: {accuracy: 0.9933, ece: 0.012, brier: 0.006, mce: 0.45}\n      qwen15b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.005, brier: 0.003, mce: 0.62}\n      codellama13b: {accuracy: 0.9983, ece: 0.003, brier: 0.002, mce: 0.75}\n      all_nonoutlier_ece_below: 0.015\n      ece_range: [0.0027, 0.012]\n      ece_ratio_vs_notrace_range: [14, 63]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration 直接跟随 accuracy 和 error 数量。三个 99.83% 模型（Qwen-7B, \n      Qwen-1.5B, CodeLlama-13B）仅有 2 个相同 error（GeneratorExit），calibration \n      差异仅来自 confidence distribution 的模型间差异：\n\n      Qwen-7B (ECE=0.0027, 已有数据): 基准。2 个 misclassified samples 的 \n      confidence 贡献几乎全部 ECE。\n\n      CodeLlama-13B (ECE≈0.003): 13B 参数量产生更 peaked softmax distribution，\n      correct predictions 的 confidence 更接近 1.0。2 个 error 的 confidence \n      也偏高（模型更 \"确定\"），但 overall 因 correct predictions 的 near-perfect \n      calibration 而 ECE 极低。略高于 Qwen-7B 因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template \n      与训练数据的 alignment 略有差异。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B (ECE≈0.005): 同 Qwen tokenizer，same 2 errors。但 1.5B 模型的 \n      softmax entropy 更高（small model less confident），correct predictions \n      的 mean confidence 可能在 ~0.95 而非 ~0.99，造成 systematic slight \n      under-confidence → ECE 略高。\n\n      DeepSeek seed42 (ECE≈0.012): 8 个 errors（vs others 的 2 个），4× 更多 \n      misclassified bins 贡献 ECE。其中部分 fail samples 被高 confidence 预测为 \n      pass（LoRA 训练不完全映射 exception→fail），这些 high-confidence wrong \n      predictions 是 ECE 的主要 contributor。但 0.012 仍远低于 no_trace 的 0.171 \n      （14× improvement）。\n\n      总体：所有模型 ECE < 0.015，exception signal 的 calibration 优势跨模型 \n      robust。magnitude 差异主要由 error count 驱动，非 signal quality 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model calibration for exception_only\"\n        columns: [Model, Accuracy, ECE, Brier, \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, \"99.83%\", 0.0027, 0.0013, \"63×\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B-Instruct, \"99.83%\", 0.003, 0.002, \"57×\"]\n          - [Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, \"99.83%\", 0.005, 0.003, \"34×\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, \"99.33%\", 0.012, 0.006, \"14×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Reliability diagram (2×2 grid): 每模型一 panel，predicted probability \n        vs observed frequency。三个 99.83% 模型的 curves 紧贴 diagonal，\n        DeepSeek 的 curve 在 0.8-0.95 bin 略偏（overconfident on some \n        misclassified samples）。\n      - >\n        ECE comparison bar chart: 4 models × exception_only，with Qwen-7B \n        的 no_trace/full_trace/VOTA ECE 作参考线。所有 exception_only bars \n        极短（≤0.012），no_trace reference line (0.171) 显著高。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 证实 exception signal 的 calibration 优势 \n      不限于 Qwen-7B——所有 4 模型 ECE ≤ 0.012，与 no_trace ECE 0.171 \n      相比 14-63× improvement。论文可 claim \"exception_only achieves \n      near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.012) across all tested models, \n      regardless of architecture and scale\"。这是独立于 accuracy 的 \n      evidence dimension：即使审稿人质疑 99.83% 是 saturation，ECE/Brier \n      数据证明模型 \"knows what it knows\"——confidence 与 correctness \n      高度一致。DeepSeek 的略高 ECE (0.012) 与其更多 errors (8 vs 2) \n      一致，不 undermine overall finding。建议作为 main text Table \n      （与 accuracy table 并列或合并为一张大表），1 GPU-hour \n      investment，cost-effective。\n\n  - name: few_shot_frontier_baseline\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception: 0.952\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_ci: [0.937, 0.965]\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception: 0.966\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_ci: [0.953, 0.977]\n      claude_0shot_exception: 0.958\n      claude_0shot_exception_ci: [0.944, 0.971]\n      claude_3shot_exception: 0.972\n      claude_3shot_exception_ci: [0.959, 0.982]\n      gpt4o_0shot_no_trace: 0.805\n      claude_0shot_no_trace: 0.821\n      sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_advantage_vs_best_frontier_pp: 2.6\n      sft_qwen15b_advantage_vs_gpt4o_pp: 2.6\n      api_cost_total_usd: 18\n      sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frontier models 的 exception_only 0-shot 能达 95-96% 因为 task 在 \n      exception_only 格式下高度 interpretable：有 [ERROR] → fail，无 [ERROR] → \n      pass。已有 local model zero-shot 数据（Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, DeepSeek 90.59%）\n      证明不需要 SFT 就能达到 ~90%+。Frontier models 更强的 instruction following \n      + 更广的 code knowledge 在此基础上再提升 ~3-5pp：\n\n      (1) GPT-4o 0-shot 95.2%：比 local Qwen-1.5B zero-shot (93.45%) 仅高 1.8pp\n      ——exception task 对 model scale 的 marginal return 很低（进一步证明是 \n      signal-limited not capacity-limited）。剩余 4.8% error 来自：GeneratorExit \n      等 non-fatal exceptions（同 SFT 模型）、format marker 的不一致解读、\n      边缘 case 的 conservative \"fail\" 偏好。\n\n      (2) 3-shot 额外 +1.4-1.4pp：exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision \n      boundary，特别是处理 [No exception data in trace] marker 的一致性。\n      但 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖 exception type 的 long-tail distribution。\n\n      (3) SFT Qwen-7B (99.83%) 仍高于 best frontier 3-shot (Claude 97.2%) \n      2.6pp。虽然 pp gap 不大，但 error count 差异显著：2 vs ~33 errors，\n      16.5× fewer mistakes。且 SFT inference cost 是 frontier API 的 ~1/1800。\n\n      (4) Frontier no_trace (80-82%) >> SFT no_trace (75.1%)：frontier model \n      的 code reasoning 能力可部分替代 trace 信息，但仍远低于 SFT + \n      exception_only (99.83%)——exception signal + SFT 的组合效果不可被 \n      单纯 model scale 替代。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs frontier few-shot comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Model, Input, Shots, Accuracy, \"Errors/1190\",\n                  \"Approx Cost\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT, Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.01\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.005\"]\n          - [SFT, CodeLlama-13B, exception_only, \"—\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"$0.02\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, 3, \"96.6%\", \"~40\", \"$8\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, exception_only, 3, \"97.2%\", \"~33\", \"$10\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, 0, \"95.2%\", \"~57\", \"$5\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, exception_only, 0, \"95.8%\", \"~50\", \"$7\"]\n          - [Few-shot, GPT-4o, no_trace, 0, \"80.5%\", \"~232\", \"$3\"]\n          - [Few-shot, Claude-3.5, no_trace, 0, \"82.1%\", \"~213\", \"$5\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-7B, no_trace, \"—\", \"75.1%\", 296, \"$0.01\"]\n      - name: \"Error count perspective (补充审稿人 'gap only 2-3pp' 的 concern)\"\n        columns: [Model, Accuracy, Errors, \"Error Reduction vs frontier best\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SFT Qwen-7B exception_only\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"Claude 3-shot exception_only\", \"97.2%\", \"~33\", \"16.5× more errors\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only\", \"96.6%\", \"~40\", \"20× more errors\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Accuracy bar chart: SFT models (4 bars at 99.83%) vs frontier \n        few-shot (4 bars at 95-97%) vs frontier no_trace (2 bars at 80-82%).\n        SFT advantage visually clear despite small pp gap — the ceiling \n        region (99%+) makes absolute difference look small but relative \n        error reduction is dramatic.\n      - >\n        Cost-accuracy scatter: x=log10(cost in $), y=accuracy (%). SFT \n        points cluster in top-left (high accuracy, low cost), frontier \n        in bottom-right. Pareto frontier clearly dominated by SFT.\n    analysis: >\n      Frontier baseline 在 median 档下提供 solid but not overwhelming \n      evidence：SFT beats frontier 3-shot by ~2.6pp (error count 16-20× \n      reduction)。这足以 claim \"task-specific SFT on 7B model surpasses \n      frontier few-shot\" 但审稿人可能视 2.6pp 为 modest。Rebuttal 策略：\n      (a) 强调 error count 而非 pp——\"from ~33 errors to 2 irreducible \n      errors\" 更有冲击力；(b) cost perspective——1800× cheaper；(c) \n      offline deployability。最有价值的发现：frontier models 也从 \n      exception traces 大幅获益 (no_trace→exception: +14-15pp)，\n      independent confirm Claim 1/2。建议 main text 用 1 paragraph + \n      1 table 呈现，full results 放 appendix。0 GPU-hours，仅 API \n      cost ~$18。如果 deadline 紧张可 deprioritize——核心 claims \n      不依赖此数据。\n\n  - name: ood_generalization_cross_language\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      python_ood_exception_only: 0.963\n      python_ood_degradation_pp: -3.5\n      java_exception_only: 0.918\n      java_degradation_pp: -8.0\n      javascript_exception_only: 0.902\n      javascript_degradation_pp: -9.6\n      cross_lang_mean: 0.928\n      cross_lang_mean_degradation_pp: -7.0\n      python_ood_no_trace: 0.715\n      java_no_trace: 0.680\n      javascript_no_trace: 0.665\n      exception_lift_over_notrace_ood_mean_pp: 24.1\n      ood_test_set_size_per_lang: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 泛化性取决于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。\n      [ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer 的统一输出规范，但 exception \n      type 名称和 error message 惯例跨语言不同，造成 token-level distribution shift。\n\n      Python OOD (-3.5pp, 96.3%): 同语言不同项目，exception type 分布与训练集 \n      高度重叠（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError 是 universal），仅 project-specific \n      custom exception classes 造成少量降级。测试集项目的 test structure（pytest \n      fixtures、多文件 import）可能引入不同的 exception context，但 [ERROR] tag \n      的 binary signal 不受影响。\n\n      Java (-8.0pp, 91.8%): NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 \n      Java-specific type names 训练集未出现——模型无法利用 type-level semantics，\n      退化到依赖 [ERROR] tag presence 的 binary heuristic。但 binary heuristic \n      本身在 Qwen-7B zero-shot 上已达 ~89%，SFT 的 fine-tuned decision boundary \n      在新 type names 上部分失效。\n\n      JavaScript (-9.6pp, 90.2%): 最大降级。JS 的 error handling 更独特（Promise \n      rejection → UnhandledPromiseRejection, async TypeError），且 error message \n      格式与 Python 差异最大。tracer 对 JS 的 [ERROR] 标注可能不如 Python \n      consistent（implementation difference）。\n\n      关键：所有语言上 exception_only lift over no_trace ≈ 24pp（与 in-domain \n      24.7pp 几乎相同），证明 exception signal 的 fault detection mechanism \n      跨语言 transferable。Absolute degradation 来自 token vocabulary shift \n      而非 mechanism failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"In-distribution vs OOD accuracy by language\"\n        columns: [Language, Setting, exception_only, no_trace, \"Lift\",\n                  \"Degradation vs ID\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Python, \"ID (HumanEval+MBPP)\", \"99.83%\", \"75.1%\", \"+24.7pp\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [Python, \"OOD (new projects)\", \"96.3%\", \"71.5%\", \"+24.8pp\", \"-3.5pp\"]\n          - [Java, OOD, \"91.8%\", \"68.0%\", \"+23.8pp\", \"-8.0pp\"]\n          - [JavaScript, OOD, \"90.2%\", \"66.5%\", \"+23.7pp\", \"-9.6pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: 4 language settings × 2 conditions (exception_only \n        vs no_trace)。exception_only lift (~24pp) 在所有 settings 上几乎 \n        constant，即使 absolute accuracy drops。Visual emphasis on preserved \n        lift rather than absolute degradation.\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 实验在 median 档下是最大 risk/reward 投资。如果完成，可 claim \n      \"exception signal advantage transfers across languages with preserved \n      lift (~24pp) despite moderate absolute degradation (7pp mean)\"——\n      部分回应 single-task scope criticism。但 risk factors：(1) 需要 \n      构建 3 个语言的 OOD 数据集（trace 生成 + 人工验证），timeline \n      紧张；(2) tracer 对 Java/JS 的 implementation 可能有 quality \n      issues，影响实验可控性；(3) 如果某语言降到 <85%，审稿人可能 \n      反向 argue \"not robust enough\"。在 ARR May 25 deadline (7天后) \n      前几乎不可能完成——建议 deprioritize，标注为 camera-ready \n      supplement 或 future work。如果有余力，优先做 Python OOD \n      （无需新 tracer，仅需新测试集），~4 GPU-hours 即可。\n\n  - name: training_dynamics_learning_curves\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve（每 ~50 steps eval）\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_frac_to_90pct: 0.05\n      exception_only_frac_to_95pct: 0.08\n      exception_only_frac_to_99pct: 0.20\n      exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n      vota_frac_to_90pct: 0.10\n      vota_frac_to_95pct: 0.15\n      vota_frac_to_99pct: 0.30\n      vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n      full_trace_frac_to_80pct: 0.30\n      full_trace_peak: {accuracy: 0.830, epoch: 1}\n      full_trace_final: 0.8176\n      full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_epoch2_dip\n      no_trace_plateau_frac: 0.15\n      no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n      no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n      convergence_ratio_exception_vs_vota: 1.9\n      convergence_ratio_exception_vs_fulltrace: 3.8\n      learning_efficiency_exception_samples_per_pp: 9.2\n      learning_efficiency_fulltrace_samples_per_pp: 68.5\n      efficiency_ratio: 7.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的 \n      影响。所有数值表示为 training fraction（0=start, 1.0=end of 3 epochs），\n      因 absolute step count 取决于 batch size 等 hyperparameters。\n\n      exception_only 收敛最快（~5% training 达 90%, ~8% 达 95%）：input 极短 \n      （mean <100 tokens），gradient 完全集中在 verdict signal 上；effective \n      unique 样本仅 2858，但 binary structure（有 exception→fail, 无→pass）\n      极其 learnable。已有 epoch-level 数据佐证：Qwen-7B exception_only 3 \n      seeds 均在 epoch1 结束时已达 99.83%（之后 epochs 无提升）——暗示 \n      实际在 epoch1 早期就已收敛。\n\n      full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：已有 epoch-level 数据 \n      （epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%, epoch3=81.76%）展示 epoch2 坍塌。\n      中间 eval 应能捕获更 fine-grained 的 oscillation pattern。峰值在 \n      ~30% training（epoch1 中后段），之后 overfitting 到 trace patterns \n      而非 verdict signal 导致 epoch2 下降。epoch3 partial recovery 可能 \n      是 random fluctuation。\n\n      VOTA 介于两者之间：含 Tier 1 (fast learning) + Tier 2 (slow learning) \n      信号，combined curve 的前段被 Tier 1 驱动（快速上升到 >95%），后段 \n      Tier 2 贡献边际提升。已有 epoch-level (epoch1=99.33%, epoch2-3=99.41%) \n      确认 epoch1 几乎完成所有学习。\n\n      no_trace 快速 plateau：无 trace signal 可学习，模型在 ~15% training \n      后耗尽 code→verdict 的弱 statistical correlation，之后 flat。\n\n      Learning efficiency ratio: exception_only 每 pp 需 ~9.2 个 effective \n      training samples（2858 unique / (99.83-75.13) pp），full_trace 需 ~68.5 \n      （~5800 / (81.76-75.13) pp），7.4× 差距直接 quantify information \n      density 的 learning advantage。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Convergence milestones (fraction of total training)\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"To 80%\", \"To 90%\", \"To 95%\", \"To 99%\", \n                  \"Final Accuracy\", \"Curve Shape\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, \"~3%\", \"~5%\", \"~8%\", \"~20%\", \"99.83%\", \"Rapid saturation\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5%\", \"~10%\", \"~15%\", \"~30%\", \"99.41%\", \"Moderate saturation\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~30%\", never, never, never, \"81.76%\", \"Non-monotonic (epoch2 dip)\"]\n          - [loop_only, \"~12%\", never, never, never, \"85.63%\", \"Slow saturation\"]\n          - [no_trace, never, never, never, never, \"75.13%\", \"Low-ceiling plateau\"]\n      - name: \"Learning efficiency comparison\"\n        columns: [Condition, \"Effective Unique Samples\", \"Lift (pp)\", \n                  \"Samples per pp\", \"Efficiency (relative)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2858, 24.7, 9.2, \"1.0× (ref)\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5800\", 24.3, 17.5, \"0.53×\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~5800\", 6.6, 72.1, \"0.13×\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"~5800\", 3.6, 132.8, \"0.07×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Learning curve plot (main figure): x=training progress (fraction), \n        y=eval accuracy (%). 4+ curves, eval points every ~2-3% of training.\n        exception_only (red solid) rockets up and saturates by ~10%, \n        VOTA (blue solid) follows ~2× slower. full_trace (green dashed) \n        shows non-monotonic pattern with epoch2 dip. no_trace (gray dotted) \n        flat at ~75%. Horizontal dashed line at 71.5% (majority baseline).\n        Visual impact: exception_only learning curve is dramatically \n        steeper than all others.\n      - >\n        Learning efficiency bar chart: samples-per-pp for each condition.\n        exception_only (9.2) vs full_trace (72.1) = 7.4× gap. Direct \n        visualization of information density effect on learning.\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 提供 process-level evidence（补充已有 \n      outcome-level evidence）。核心 finding：exception_only 不仅 final \n      accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也 7.4× higher——denser signal \n      → faster and better learning。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve \n      （epoch2 dip from 83% to 76%）是 information overload 的 dynamic \n      manifestation：模型先学到 some useful trace patterns (epoch1 peak)，\n      然后 overfits to noise (epoch2 collapse)，部分恢复 (epoch3)。\n      这呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)。\n\n      审稿人可能 challenge: \"faster convergence is trivially expected \n      for shorter sequences\"。Rebuttal: shorter sequences + diagnostic \n      signal concentration 共同作用——loop_only 的 sequence 长度与 \n      full_trace 相当但 efficiency 5× higher (因 loop 信号 denser than \n      raw trace)，证明不只是 length effect。\n\n      建议作为 Figure in main text（visual impact 强）但不升为 \n      standalone claim。需修改 train_sft.py 添加 intermediate eval \n      callback，8 GPU-hours。如果 deadline 紧张，可引用现有 \n      epoch-level 数据（epoch1 vs epoch3）作为 coarse-grained proxy \n      代替 fine-grained learning curve。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ca021833-68ad-48d2-8c47-9a2b5434c32f","total_cost_usd":1.7700597500000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":4407,"cache_creation_input_tokens":93399,"cache_read_input_tokens":148822,"output_tokens":42126,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":93399,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4404,"output_tokens":14337,"cache_read_input_tokens":83511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21729,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21729},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36590,"outputTokens":26,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.036719999999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4407,"outputTokens":42126,"cacheReadInputTokens":148822,"cacheCreationInputTokens":93399,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.7333397499999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8b85ead1-7bb5-44e3-a599-98701e0e8d74"}
